<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Maluku</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malobhe gha Mbone ngita chighajhandikwe na Maluku</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maluku</para>
  <para style="toc3">Malu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Malobhe gha Mbone ngita chighajhandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maluku</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Malobhe gha Mbone ngita chighajhandikwe na Maluku ndi chimo cha itabho ncheche ya Lilaghano liyono ghighachimulila ughome gwa Yecho Kilichitu. Kila chimo cha itabo yenio ikemwa “Injili.” Lilobhe lyenio mana jhake “Lilobhe lya Mbone.” Itabo henge ikajhandikwe na Matei na Maluku na Luka na Yohane pajhomwika Yecho. Malobhe gha Mbone ngita Chighajhandikwe na Maluku chenie kitabo kijhipe kulenganicha na henge ncheche. Helahela bhando bhalongela kitabo chenje kikalongolile kujhandikwa kuliku henge, kikajhandikwe chaka cha makome chita na nhwano ade makome chaba pabhelwikwa Yecho Kilichitu. Bhubhachomite bhakilichitu lende likajhandikwe ku muche gwa ku Roma kwa kupala kwalekela mwojho Akakilichitu bhubhakibha kwenio.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jwenio Maluku amanyikana ngita Yohane Maluku, akibha atyangita pamonga na Napauli na Banaba, ajhakukana kulongohana nabho mu mwanja gwa kutangacha Malobhe gha Chapanga Mahengo, 13:13. Peniya Maluku ajhakulongohana kabhele na Banaba, Mahengo, 15:37-39. Maluku akamanyikine nkoche mundo Petile 1 Petile 5:13. Nambo Maluku akibha kangombo jwandina, Yecho patumbwila lihengo lyake, bhubhachoma twe bha majhandiko gha Chapanga bhihobholela Maluku akajhandike malobhe ghalongela Petile, na peniya pughatumbwile Malobhe ngita chighajhandikwe na Maluku. Nkate mwa Malobhe ghanga, Maluku akachanii kubhehe mmolwa jwa Yecho, na mabholo gha Yecho kwa machiko gha kujhomolela.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Maluku apiya ulongolelo gwa kitabo chake, mu chula jha 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Maluku alongela mahengo gha Yecho pakibha ku Galilaya, mu chula jha 1:14-8:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Peniya alongela mwanja gwa Yecho ku Yeluchalemo, mu chula, 8:22-10:52.</para>
  <para style="io">Maluku ajhomolela kwa kujhandika muda gwa Yecho ku Yeluchalemu, pamonga na kuwegha na kuyoka kwake, mu chula jha 11:1-16:8.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Yohane Mbatichajhe atangachi bhando panane jha Yecho Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matei 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohane 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Ghangano ndi Malobhe gha Mbone gha Yecho Kilichitu, Mwana jwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Ikatumbwii ngita chikajhandikwe mukitabo cha nnondole jwa Chapanga Isaya, dolokeya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Chapanga akalongii, ‘Nanintuma jumbe gwango</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">atengeneche ndela jhino.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Mundo ilalama kanonoho kunjenga, alongila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Ntengeneche ndela jha Bhambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">nnyocha ndela jhake!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Yohane Mbatichajhe ajhakujhenda kunjenga, atangachila bhando na kwabaticha. Abhalobholila bhando, “Muuleke uhakaho na kubatichwa. Chapanga nanekekeya uhakaho gwino.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Bhando bhamahele kuhumii ku kilambo chaku Yudeya na muche gwa ku Yeluchalemo bhakajhahwii kwa Yohane kunyokanikiya na kulonge uhakaho ghubhatehila na jwenio Yohane ajhakwabaticha mulukemba lwa ku Yolodane.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Yohane ahwalita magwanda ghighatenganichwe kwa mangoma gha kinyama jwakemitwa ngamiya na luhunga lwa limbendela mukibhuno chake. Na kulye madidima na bhuche. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Yohane akatangachii bhando, “Jwahika ngohengohe payeto jhango, jhuna likakala kumbeta nenga, nitope ndeka kujhinama na kubhopo lughojhe lwa maghubache ghake. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Nenga nibaticha kwa mache, nambo jwenio jwahika chabaticha kwa Uhuke gwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ubaticho gwa Yecho na kujhighanikiwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matei 3:13-4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Machiko gheniya Yecho akahikite kubhoke ku Nachalete ku kilambo cha ku Galilaya, na kubatichwa na Yohane mulukemba lwa ku Yolodane. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Papa tugha Yecho papitita umache, ajhakulibhona lihunde lidindwike, Uhuke gwa Chapanga ujhakuhuluka ngita ngunda. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Na lilobhe lya Chapanga kuhumii kunane kwa Chapanga, “Lilongila mwenga ndi ma Mwanango jhunimpahile, anganichwe na mwenga.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Papalapala, Uhuke gwa Chapanga ujhakunongocha kujhenda kunjenga. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Akatamite kwenio machiko makome ncheche, ajhakujhighanikilwa na Limbembela akibha na inyama ya kumanyahe, nambo akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga bhajhakuntangatila.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho abhakema bhapyeya homba ncheche bhankengame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matei 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Yohane patabhitwa mukipungo, Yecho ajhakujhenda ku Galilaya, na kwatangachila bhando Malobhe gha Mbone gha Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Akalongii, “Machiko gwa Unahota gwa Chapanga ghahikite. Muuleke uhakaho gwino na kuhenga ghambone na kughahobholela Malobhe gha Mbone!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Yecho patyangita umbwane jha ku Galilaya, ajhakwabhona akalongo bhabhele bhapyeya homba Simone na nnongo mundo Anduleya, bhapyehita homba kwa lwaho.<figure style="fig" alt="A person fishing with a net" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" ref="1:16">Mundo jwapyeya homba </figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Ungengame nenga nanimmola kwapyeha bhando ngita hele chimupyeya homba.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Papalapala bhajhakuleka lwaho lwabhe na kunkengama.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Yecho Pahikita palonge, ajhakwabhona Yakobu na Yohane nnongo mundo Zebedayo, bheniya bhakibha nkate jha mungalabha jhabhe bhalenganikila lwaho lwabhe. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Yecho ajhakwakema, na bhene bhajhakunneka tate gwabhe Zebedayo bhibhahenga mahengo mwenio mungalabha, na kunkengama.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho inamicha mundo jhuna nchuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Yecho na bhabholwa bhake bhakahikite pabomane jha ku Kapelenaumo, likibha Lichiko lya Kupomolela, ajhakujhingii munyumba jha kukonganikii Akayahude na kutumbuu kubhola Malobhe gha Mbone. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Bhando bhoha bhubhanyokanikiya bhakahechwike chabholita, nhwalo abholita ndeka ngita chibhabholita bhabhola bhabhe bha Malaghalikilo, nambo abholita ngita jhuna ukindendeke.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Papalapala, mundo jhumo ajhakujhingii nkate munyumba jha kukonganikii Akayahude achikii nchuka, ajhakutumbuu kulalama. <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>“Alongila mmii na nike na twenga, mwenga Yecho bhuku Nachalete? Bho, uhikite kutukoma? Nimanyite mwenga maghane. Mwenga manyahinyahi kuhumii kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yecho ajhakuupwatalila nchuka alongila, “Tama nuu! Mummoke mundo jhonjo!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Nchuka ajhakunyuanyua kwa makakala na kulela kanonoho, na kubhoka. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Bhando bhoha bhakakangiche, bhajhakukonyana, “Ghanga mambu ghane kabhele? Bho, mabholo mayono? Mundo hojho ukindendeke gwa kuipwatalila michuka na kunnyeketela!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Bhahe, Malobhe gha Yecho ghajhakuchobhela kajhombe ku kilambo cha ku Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ilamicha bhando bhamahele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matei 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Yecho na bhabholwa bhake, pubhapitita munyumba jha kukonganikii Akayaude, bhajhakujhenda kajha kwa Simone na Anduleya. Yakobu na Yohane bhakalongohine nabho. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Bhahe, nkohano mundo Simone, akibha agholwike pakindanda, atenda kulwalwa. Papalapala Yecho pahikita bhajhakunnobholela ulwalo gwa majhe. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Papa Yecho ajhakujhenda kwa majhe jhola, ajhakukamuu lubhoko na kunyinua. Ulwalo ghola ajhakulama, na jwenio ajhakutumbuu kwatelekela.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Palitipika lyobha kimihe, bhando bhajhakwaleta bhoha bhibhalwalwa na bhibhachikile na michuka kwa Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Bhando bhamahele bha kubomane bhakakonganike palonge jha lubhanja lwa nyumba. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Yecho akalamiche bhando bhamahele na bhibhakibha na ulwalo ghoghoha, kabhele ajhakubhapiya bhibhakibha na michuka jhamahena, akabhapekii jhe pwache jha kulonge nhwalo bhakaumanyite jwenio ndi ghane.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho abhatangachii bhando ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Pantondogholo, kabula jha kuchegha, Yecho ajhakujhenda pakiyepela ajhakutumbu kunyopa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simone na ajhake bhakajhahwii kumpalaha Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Pubhammonita, bhakannobholile, “Kila mundo impalaha mwenga.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Yecho abhalobholile, “Tujhende muchenda henge kutangacha Malobhe gha Chapanga, mana hikite kuhenga lihengo lyenio.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Bhahe, ajhakujhenda kubomane jha ku Galilaya atangicha malobhe gha Chapanga munyumba jha kukonganikii Akayahude kongo abhengita nchuka.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho anamicha mundo jhuna Malohe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matei 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Lichiko limo mundo jhumo jwakwete malohe akahikite kwa Yecho, ajhakutama makilikite, kumpembelekeya, “Anda mipala, unyelebhula nenga!”<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yecho ajhakummone kiya, ajhakuhatambuu lubhoko lwake, ajhakunkamula na kunongelela, “Nipala! Nnyelebhuke!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Papalapala malohe ajhakulama mundo jhola. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Bhahe, Yecho ajhakunnobholela, ajhende na kongo ankanikihe, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>Dolokeya, “Nkotoka kunobhole mundo jhojhoha, nambo nnyende mukakilangiye kwa mupiya litambiko jwa Chapanga, na mpeleke litambiko lino kwa nhwalo gwa kujhelebhuka kwino ngita chalaghalikie Mucha nhwalo gwa kwalangii bhando bhoha nnamite.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Nambo mundo jhola ajhakujhenda na kutumbuu kutangacha malobhe kila chehemo, na kulonge mambu twe, na Yecho akibha pakiyepela. Akibha panja, bhando bhakannyendelile kuhumii kila kimbokotole.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yecho inamicha mundo jwatengwike</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matei 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Pughapitita machiko ghandina, Yecho akabhujhite ku Kapelenaumo, bhando bhakapatite malobhe Yecho abhii ukajha. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Bhahe, bhakahikite bhando bhamahele napwache ikibha jhe pannyango bhakatwelile ade panja. Yecho akibha atangacha Malobhe gha Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Papalapala bhakannetite mundo jwatengwike bhanyeghite bhando ncheche bhampelika kwa Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Nhwalo gwa kujholoka bhando, bhakahotwii ndeka kumandikii Yecho. Bhahe, bhakatenganiche lihoto panane jha pakipaghalo pabhii Yecho. Pubhajhomolila kuhotola bhajhakuhuluwa jwalwalwa mu mpacha gwake. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Yecho palolita kihobholelo chabhe, ajhakunnobholela mundo jwatengwike, “Mwanango, nnekekiwe uhakaho gwino.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Bhabhola bhange bha Malaghalikilo gha Mucha bhibhakatamite bhajhakutumbuu kuwacha kumiojho jhabhe, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“Nhwalo gwa nike mundo hojho kulonge naha? Atenda kulapanikiya anigha Chapanga! Abhii jhe mundo jwahoto kulekekeya uhakaho, nambo Chapanga kanjika ndo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Papalapala Yecho akamanye chibhahola kumiojho jhabhe, ajhakwakonya, “Nike chimiwacha naha kumiojho jhino? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Lihengo ghane lilijhojwike, kunongelela mundo hojho jwatengwike, ‘Uhakaho gwino ulekekiwe,’ amu kulonge, ‘Nnyeme! Tola mpacha gwino nnyende?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Bhahe, nipala umanye naha, Mwana gwa Mundo jhuna ukindendeke gwa kulelekeya uhakaho pannema.” Peniya anongalile mundo jwatengwike jhola, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>“Ninobholila, jhinuka, tola mpacha gwino nnyende kajhino!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Na bhando bhoha pubhannolakiya jwakatengwike jhola akajhinuka, papalapala ajhakughegha mpacha gwake na kujhenda. Bhando bhoha bhajhakukangacha, bhajhakunnomba Chapanga. Bhalongila, “Tunawai jhe kulola ilebhe ngita henge!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ankema Lawe ankengame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matei 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yecho akajhahwii kabhele mupelemupele mwa lilabha. Bhando bhamahele bhakankengimile, na jwenio akatumbuu kwabhola malobhe gha Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Pakibha atyangita, akamweine Lawe mwana gwa Alufayo, atamite panyumba jha kulepe kode. Yecho ajhakunnobholela, “Hika ungengame!” Lawe akajhemite, ajhakunkengama.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Peniya Yecho pakibha atamite kajha kwa Lawe kulyegha. Akatola kode bhamahele na bhando bhibhakanwa bhibhakibha bhakankengime Yecho. Na bhamahele bhakatamite pamonga na Yecho bhalila na bhabholwa bhake. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Bhahe, Bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo bhibhakibha Mapwalichayo pubhalolita Yecho ilyegha pamonga na bhando bhina uhakaho, pamo na akatola kode, bhajhakwakonya bhabholwa bhake, “Bho, mulyegha na bhando ngita bhamba?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Yecho akabhajhohine ajhakwalobholela, “Bhando bhangalwalwa bhipala ndeka nng'anga, bhibhalwalwa bhala tugha ndi bhibhamipala nng'anga. Nenga hikitejhe kwakema bhando bha umbone bhangengame, nambo bhando bhibhabhii akahakaho.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhe gha kupunga kulyegha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matei 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Bhabholwa bha Yohane Mbatichajhe na bha Mapwalichayo bhakibha bhatehila kupunga kulyegha. Bhahe, bhando bhajhakunnyendela Yecho na kunkonya, “Nhwalo ghane bhabholwa bha Yohane na Mapwalichayo bhapungita, nambo mwenga bhino bhipunga ndeka?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yecho ajhakwajhanguu, “Bho, bhando bhibhalalikwe kuunyagho gwa ndowa bhahoto kupunga pamonga na nnyinamwale? Pubhabhii pamo na nnyinamwale ihoto ndeka kupunga. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Dolokeya lichiko nalihika nnyinamwale nabhejhe pamo, na lichiko lyenio nabhahotola kupunga.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>“Abhii jhe mundo jwabhambakila kibhambo kubhoka mungobho nhyono na kuchonolela mukindukotuko. Anda atenda naha, kibhambo kiyono nakilombotoka kindukotuko chenie, na pala pupakibha pajwepwike napajhonjekeka. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Abhii jhe mundo jwabheka divaye yono mulihako lilitukutwike. Anda atenda naha, divaye naitutumuka na kujwepula lihako lyenio, divaye naijhitika na lihako kujwepuka. Divaye yono ubheka mulihako liyono!”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilobhe lya Lichiko lya Kupomolela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matei 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Lichiko limo lya Kupomolela, Yecho pamonga na bhabholwa bhake bhajhakupeta mu mighonda jha mapemba. Pubhatyangita, bhabholwa bhake bhakatumbwii kukwanyula manjwanjwane gha mapemba. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Mapwalichayo bhajhakunnobholela Yecho, “Dolokeya! Bho, nhwalo gwa nike bhabholwa bhino bhihenga kilebhe chamaha jhe Lichiko lya Kupomolela?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Yecho ajhakujhanguu, “Bho, mukachomitejhe ghahengita Daude pamonga na ajhake pubhakibha na njala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Daude akajhingii mu Nyumba jha Chapanga na kulyegha mabumunda ghighapihitwa litambiko kwa Chapanga. Lijhambu lende lihengika pakibha Abiatale Nkolo jwa Bhabhola. Bhibhatambika kanjika chabhe ndi bhalila mabumunda gheniya. Nambo Daude akalile, kabhele ajhakwapekeya akapiya matambiko ajhake.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Bhahe, Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Lichiko lya Kupomolela libhii kwatangatila bhando, chi bhando kulikengemila Lichiko lya Kupomolela. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Nambo Mwana gwa Mundo, ndi Bhambo jwa Lichiko lya Kupomolela.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yecho inamicha mundo jwatengwike lubhoko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matei 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Kabhele Yecho ajhakujhingii munyumba jha kukonganikii Akayahude. Mwenio akibha mundo jwatengwike lubhoko. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Bhando bhange bhapaliya kihokola cha kunkamuu Yecho. Bhajhakuningulila anda chanamicha mundo Lichiko lya Kupomolela. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Yecho akannobholile mundo jwatengwike lubhoko jhola, “Nhwike palonge pano.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Chakaka, akakonyite bhando, “Bho, nike chambone kuhenga Lichiko lya Kupomolela, kuntangatila amu kuntendela uhakaho? Kughombola ughome gwa mundo amu kunkoma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Nambo bheniya bhakajhangwiijhe kilebhe. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Yecho akalolikii bhando kwa lilaka, peniya ajhakunyongeka kumwojho kwa kukokotoka kwa miojho jhabhe. Bhahe, Yecho akanobholile mundo jhola, “Atambula lubhoko!” Na jwenio ajhakuatambuu lubhoko lwake ajhakulama. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Peniya Mapwalichayo bhakapitite panja, bhajhakukongana na bhando bha Helode na bhajhakupalaha ndela jha kunkoma Yecho.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilongo lya bhando linkengama Yecho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yecho pamonga na bhabholwa bhake, bhakajhahwii mupele mulilabha lya ku Galilaya na lilongo lya bhando likankengime, bhahumila ku Galilaya na ku Yudeya. <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Bhando pubhajhohina ghoha ghateii, bhando mahena bhakahika kubhoka ku Yudeya na ku Yeluchalemo na ku Idumeya na chenda jhibhii kwiye jha lukemba lwa ku Yolodane na miche jha ku Tilo na ku Sidone. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Nhwalo gwa bhando kujholoka, Yecho akalobhalile bhabholwa bhake bhantengenechele ngalabha bhando bhakoto kunkangana. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Nhwalo alamiche bhando bhamahele, bhibhalwalwa bhoha bhajhakuheghelela bhapala kumpapaha. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Na bhando bhina michuka pubhamwonita, bhajhakugwegha palonge jhake na kulalama, “Mwenga ndi Mwana gwa Chapanga!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Nambo Yecho ajhakwapwatalila kwa likakala nchuka ukoto kwalobholela bhando jwenie ndi ghane.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ihaghuu akatenga kome na bhabhele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matei 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Yecho akahobhike pakitombe, ajhakwakema jwabhapaii jwenio, na bhene bhajhakunyendela. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Jwenio akabhahagwii bhando kome na bhabhele, ajhakwakema akatenga. Ajhakwalobholela, “Nihagwii mangota mwenga kutama na nenga kwatangachii bhando Malobhe gha Mbone. <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>Na mangota namaha na ukindendeke gwa kubhenga michuka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Bhamba ndi bhando kome na bhabhele bhakabhahagwii. Simone Yecho akampekihe liina lya Petile, <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Yakobu na Yohane, bhana bha Chebedayo bheniya Yecho akabhapekihe liina Boanelige, mana jhake, “Bhando bhubhabhii ngita Ulumbilo na kwa malobhe ghange bhikemwa bhina kipyaho.” <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Anduleya na Filipu na Batulomayo na Matei na Tomache na Yakobu mwana gwa Alufayo na Tadayo na Simone jwakemita Chelote, mana jhake nkomanii kilambo chake. <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>Na Yuda Ichikaliyote, jwanyambila Yecho.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho na Belezebule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matei 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Peniya Yecho akajhahwii kajha, bhando bhamahele bhakakonganike kabhele ade Yecho na bhabholwa bhake bhakahotwii ndeka kulyegha. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Akalongo bhake Yecho bhakajhohine malobhe, bhakajhahwii kuntola nhwalo bhalongela jhuna ngholoka.<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Na Bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo gha Mucha bhubhahumila ku Yeluchalemo bhakalongii, “Akwete Belezebule! Nkolo jwa michuka jwenio jwapiya likakala lya kubhenga michuka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Yecho akakemite, ajhakwalobholela kwa kulandanikiya, “Limbembela lihoto bho kummenga Limbembela? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Unahota nkolongwa ghoghoha ghola anda upechengine gwenie kwa gwenie na kubhehe ibhogha ibhogha gwihoto ndeka kujhema, na bhando bha nyumba jhimo. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Anda bhando bha nyumba bhapechangine ibhoghaibhogha, nyumba jhene nahigwa tugha. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Anda Unahota gwa Limbembela upechengine ibhoghaibhogha, unahota gwonio naubhejhe na likakala.”<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>“Abhii jhe mundo jwapala kujhingii munyumba jha mundo jhuna likakala na kutolajhe ilebhe yake, ade antabhe mundo jwenio. Peniya nahotola kumpoka ilebhe yake.”<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>“Ninnobholela chakaka, bhando nabhalekekewa uhakaho gwabhe na kulapanikiya kwabhe. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Nambo mundo jhojhoha jwauligha Uhuke gwa Chapanga nahotola ndeka kulekekewa uhakaho gwake, nahighalika na uhakaho gwake machiko ghoha ghangapeta.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Yecho akalongii naha nhwalo gwa bhando bhakannobhalille, “Abhii na michuka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Majhe na akalongo bhake Yecho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matei 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Peniya majhe mundo Yecho na akalongo bhake bakahikite. Akalongo bhakajhemite panja, bhakantumite mundo kunkema Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Bhando bhamahele bakantindii Yecho, na mundo jhumo mmola akanobhalile, “Majhe gwino na akalongo bhino bhabhii panja, bhipalaha mwenga.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Yecho ajhakwakonya, “Bho, majhe gwango na akalongo bhango akina ghane?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Peniya akalolakiye bhando bhubhantindii ajhakulonge, “Dolokeya! Nalobholela bhamba anda majhe gwango na akalongo bhango! <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Mundo jhojhoha jwahenga ghapala Chapanga, jwenio ndi nnombo gwango na nhwacha gwango na majhe gwango.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Nnandanikiho gwa mmicha mbejho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matei 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Yecho akatumbwii kubhola kabhele muupele jha lilabha. Bhando bhamahele bhakannendile ajhingii mungalabha na kutama mwenio. Na bhando bhoha bhakibha muupele jha lilabha. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Akabholite ilebhe yamahena kwa kulandanikila, na pa mabholo ghake, akalobholile.<verse eid="MRK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Unyokanikiye! Mundo jhumo akajhahwii kunng'onda kumicha mbejho. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Pamichita mbejho, mbejho henge ikahikii pandela, ijhune ijhakuhika na kuhonyola. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Henge ikaponi mu ihekendo, undope ukibha ndeka gwamahele. Ijhakumela kajhombe kwa nhwalo undope ukibha ndeka gwamahele. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Lyobha lijhakubhala, ijhakutinika, kwa nhwalo mikegha jhake ikajhabhulile jhe pahe, mbejho yela ijhakulelebhala. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Henge ikaponikiye mu mikongo jha mibha, ikakolite jhe nhwalo ikahindamine mbejho ikapambike jhe. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Mbejho henge ikaponi muundope gwambone. Mbejho ijhakumela, ijhakukola na kupambika, makome matato, henge makome chita, na henge makome kome.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Peniya Yecho ajhakulonge, “Jhuna machikilo gha kujhoha na ajhohe!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mana jha nnandanikiho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matei 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Yecho pakibha kanjika chake ndo, bhabholwa kome na bhabhele na bhando bhange kunkonya nhwalo jha nnandanikiho gwenio. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Mangota mpatite kumanya chile jha Unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga hotuhotu. Nambo bheniya bhubhabhii panja bhakibhola kwa nnandanikiho tugha, <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>nambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Balinge bhakoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">nambo bhakoto kulola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Bhajhohe bhakoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">nambo bhakoto kumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">ngabhamanya ngabhang'alambukii Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">na jwenio ngalekekiye bhando mahakaho ghabhe.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ilonge hotuhotu mana jha nnandanikiho gwa mmicha mbejho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matei 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Peniya Yecho ajhakwakonya, “Bho, mangota mukamanyite jhe mana jha nnandanikiho? Bho, naumanya nnandanikiho ghonge? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Mmicha mbejho umicha Lilobhe lya Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Bhando bhange bhakalandine na mbejho ikagwelile pandela pibhajhoha malobhe gha Chapanga, Limbembela uhika na kubhoha Lilobhe lya Chapanga ku mwojho gwabhe. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Bhando bhange bhakalandine na mbejho iponi mukihekendo. Peniya pibhajhoha Lilobhe lya Chapanga, ujheketela kwa kuhangana. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Nhwalo gwanga mikegha kujhenda pahe. Uhimbilila pandina tugha anda ghapitii malola nhwalo gwa Lilobhe lya Chapanga peniya ulileka. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Bhando bhange bhakalandine na mbejho ikagwelii pa mibha. Bhalijhoha Lilobhe lya Chapanga, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>nambo iholo ya pannema ghongo, na kupalaha ilebhe henge, kupalaha ilebhe ya payegha, nabhene bhatenda ndeka chilipala Lilobhe. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Bhando bhange ulandanakiwa na mbejho igweli paundope gwambone. Bhalijhoha Lilobhe lya Chapanga, ujheketele na kupambika uhohe, bhange makome matato na bhange makome chita na bhange makome kome.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnandanikiho gwa kolobohi jhiyekelilwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Yecho ajhakujhendelela kwalobholela, “Bho, abhii mundo jwapamba kolobohi na kugubikila kibhegha nkate amu kubheka kuhe kukindanda? Bho, ubheka panane jha kinala? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Bhahe, kilebhe chochoha chikihihitwe nakibhonekana na kilebhe chochoha chikiyekulilwe nakiyekulilwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Jhuna machikilo gha kujhoha na abangatuka!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Peniya ajhakwalobholela, “Unyokanikiye chininnobholela, Chapanga napemela kipemo cheche chimwapemela. Nantenda umanye kupeta gheniya. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>jwabhii na kilebhe, jwenio najhonjekewa chenge, nambo jhola jwangabhehe nacho hote cheneche chakihobholela napokwa.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnandano gwa mbejho jhimela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Yecho ajhakujhendelela kwalobholela, “Unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga ulandanikiwe na mundo jwajhenda kumicha mbejho kunng'onda. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Kilo igholoka, muhe abhe miho mbejho imela na kukola. Jwenio amanyitejhe chikihengeka. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Undope uitenda mbejho imele. Itumbuu kulingulila, upiya lihamba na njechele, peniya ndi upatika. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Mbejho puikomala, mundo jwenio najhenda kuhuna kwa kikwakwa, nhwalo muda gwa mahuno uhikite.” <figure style="fig" alt="A person harvesting grain with a sickle" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" ref="4:29">Mundo jwahuna kwa kikwakwa</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnandanikiho gwa mbejho njokombe jhikemwa aladale</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matei 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela kabhele, “Bho, Unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga ulandine na nike? Bho, tulongela nike? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Ulengana na mbejho jhikemwa aladale, mbejho njokombe kupeta mbejho yoha, bhando umicha muundope. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Anda imichitwe, ukola na kubhehe nkongo nkolongwa kupeta mikongo jhoha munng'onda. Na gwene ubhe na lindabhe likolongwa ijhune uhika kuchenga mihuhe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Yecho akatangachii Malobhe gha milandanikiho jhamahena, akabhalobhalii ngita chibhahotola kujhoha kwabhe. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Akalongii nabho ndeka changa milandanikiho. Pakibha na bhabholwa bhake pakiyepela, akalobholii hotuhotu kila kilebhe.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ipwatalila kimbonga kikolongwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matei 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Lichiko lele, kimihe, Yecho akalobholile bhabholwa bhake, “Tujhomboke kwiye ku lilabha.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Bhahe, bhabholwa bhajhakulitabhuka lilongo lya bhando na kujhingii mungalabha na kubhoka pamo na Yecho. Helahela bhando bhange bhakajhingii mungalabha na kunkengama. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Peniya kijhakupeti kimbonga kikolongwa na matuhe gha mache ghajhakutumbuu kuityala ngalabha na ikatumbwii kutwele mache.<figure style="fig" alt="A boat in a storm" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" ref="4:37">Ngalabha mukimbunga kikolongwa</figure> <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Yecho akibha kuyeto jha ngalabha achaghamii nchaghamilo bhabholwa bhake bhajhakunyimua, bhanobholile, “Mmola, bho mutubhone jhe kiya twe kumilwa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Yecho akajhimwike, akapwatalii kimbonga kikolongwa na akakilobholi kimbonga, “Tama! Nuu!” Peniya kimbonga kijhakuleka na pajhakubhe teeke. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Peniya ajhakwalobhalela bhabholwa bhake, “Nhwalo ghane mijhoghopa? Bho, nkwete jhe kihobholelo?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Na bhene bhajhakujhoghopa hake, bhajhakukonyana, “Bho, jhonjo mundo ghane, ade kimbonga kinyeketela!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yecho inamicha mundo jhuna nchuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matei 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Yecho na bhabholwa bhake bhakahikite kwiye mwa lilabha mu kilambo cha Akagelache, <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Yecho papitita mungalabha, ajhakukongana na mundo jhuna michuka kuhumii kumambe. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Mundo hojho atamita ku mambe akibha jhe mundo jwahotwila kuntabha kabhele ata kwa minyololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Nhwalo bhatabhita mabhoko na magholo, akatopwii minyololo jhibhatabhita magholo ghake. Abhii jhe mundo jhuna likakala jwahotwila kunkamula. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Muhe na kilo atyangita kumambe na kwitombe, kongo alalima na akihekita kwa maghanga.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Mundo jwenio pamonita Yecho chukutale, ajhakumutukila, na kutama makilikite. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>Ajhakulela kwa Lilobhe likolongwa, alongila, “Yecho Mwana gwa Chapanga Jwa Kunane mipalaha nike kwa nenga? Kwa liina lya Chapanga, nkotoka kung'aha!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Alongila naha Yecho, “Nchuka mummoke mundo hojho!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Yecho ajhakunkonya, “Liina lino ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Na jwenio pajhangwila, “Liina lyango, ‘Lilongo,’ nhwalo tubhii twe.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Peniya ijhakumpembelekeya Yecho akoto kwabhenge panja jha kilambo chela.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Pakibha na lilongo likolongwa lya magholobhe ghalila muluhelelo lwa kitombe. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Peniya michuka bhajhakumpembelekeya Yecho, “Mutulekekehe tughajhingii gheniya magholobhe.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yecho ajhakwalekekeya. Peniya michuka ijhakummoka mundo jhola na kujhingii magholobhe. Lilongo lyoha lya magholobhe ghakibha elufo ibhele bhajhakutilila muluhelelo na kutumbukii mulilabha na kuwelela mwenio.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Akalucha magholobhe bhajhakutila na kwatangachila bhando bha kubomane na muchenda. Na bhando bhajhakujhenda kulolekeya chikipitile. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Pubhahikite kwa Yecho, bhajhakumona mundo jhola jhuna nchuka. Atamite pahe ahwalite ngobho na malango ghahengwite, na bhando bhoha bhajhakujhogopa. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Na bhando bhubhalolite lijhambu lyenio bhajhakwalobholela bhando bhange kilebhe chikimpitile mundo jhola jhuna nchuka na ghighapitii kwa magholobhe.<verse eid="MRK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Peniya bhajhakunnyopa Yecho abhoke mu kilambo chabhe.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Yecho pajhingila mungalabha, mundo jwakibha na nchuka ajhakumpembekeya bhajhende bhoha.<verse eid="MRK 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Nambo Yecho ajhakukana, ajhakunobholela, “Nnyende kajha kwa akalongo bhino, na mwalobholele ghantendi Bhambo kwa kumone kiya.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Peniya mundo jwenio ajhakujhenda, ku Miche Kome na kwatangachila bhando chantendii Yecho. Na bhando bhoha bhibhajhohina bhajhakuhechuka.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho inamicha majhe jhumo na nchikana jwa Jailu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matei 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Peniya Yecho pajhombwika kabhele kwiye jha lilabha kwa ngalabha, bhando bhamahele bhakakonganike na kuntindila. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Peniya kilongoche jhumo jwa munyumba jha kukonganiki Akayahude liina lyake Jailu, pamonita Yecho ajhakutama makilikite pamagholo ghake. <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>Ajhakumpembekeya, alongila, “Nchikana gwango atenda kulwalwa tolatola. Chonde nhwike mu mekele mabhoko ghino alame na abhehe na ughome.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Bhahe, Yecho ajhakulongohana nako. Lilongo likolongwa lijhakunkengama, na kuhindamana hindamana.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Peniya pakibha na mwikeghe jhumo jhuna ulwalo gwa pihe jhangajhoma kwa yaka kome na ibhele. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Mwikeghe jwenio akalaghite kwele kujhenda kwa nghanga na kujhitana ilebhe yake, nambo akapatite jhe ulamo na akajhendelii kulwalwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Mwikeghe jwenio pajhohina Yecho ilamicha bhando, ajhakupekenyela palilongo, ajhakunyendela Yecho cha kuhyeto na kupapaha lilombolo lya ngobho jhake, <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Ajhakukilobholela, “Anda hotwii kukamuu ngobho jhake, namite.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Pakamwila ligwanda lyake Yecho, papalapala miyahe ijhakuleka kupita, na jwenio ajhakukijhoha payegha jhake palamite. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Peniya Yecho akamanyite likakala lyake linnamiche mundo jwenio. Bhahe, ajhakulighalambukila lilongo lya bhando, kulikonya, “Ghane jwambapii ngobho yango?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Bhabholwa bhake bhajhakunnyanguu, “Mibhona bhando chibhakangana kangana. Bho, minkonya ghane jwampapiye?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Nambo Yecho akajhendelile kulolekeya aumanye ghane jwampapiye. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Peniya ndi mwikeghe jwenio akamanyite kilebhe chakipatite, ajhakukilaha kongo atehila kulendema, ajhakutama makilikite palonge jha Yecho, peniya ajhakunnobholela chakaka ghoha. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Yecho ajhakunnobholela, “Nchikana gwango, kihobholelo chino kinamiche. Nnyende kwa uteeke, na ulwalo gwino ulame.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Yecho pakibha amela akalonge, bhando bhange bhakahikite kuhumii kajha kwa Jailu kilongoche nkolo jwa nyumba jha kukonganikii Akayahude ajhakunnobholela, “Nchikana jwino ajhomwike. Bho, mijhendelela kuntotoha mmola?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Yecho kwa kujhoha gheniya ghibhalongila, ajhakunobholela kilongoche nkolongwa jwa nyumba jha kukonganikii Akayahude, “Nkotoka kujhoghopa, mwe nnyohe.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Yecho akapahi jhe mundo jhonge alongohane, nambo akajhahwii na Petile na Yakobu na Yohane nnongo mundo Yakobu. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Pibhahikita munyumba jha kilongoche Jailu, Yecho ajhakujhoha bhando bhalelita malelo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Yecho akajhingii nkate, “Ajhakwalobholela, nhwalo ghane michobhela na kulela? Mwana ahwii jhe, nambo atekugholoka.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Bhene bhajhakunheka kwa kumpucha. Nambo ajhakwapiya bhoha panja, ajhakuntola tate na majhe gwa mwana jwenio pamo na bhabholwa bhake bhatato, bhajhakujhingii pa bwalo pagholwike mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Akankamwii lubhoko na kulongole, “Talita kome,” mana jhake, “Nchikana, ninnobholela nnyimuke!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Papalapala mwana jhola ajhakujhimuka na kutyanga, mwana jwenio akibha na yaka kome na mibhele. Peniya bhando bhakahechwike hake. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Yecho ajhakwakanakiya kwa lilaka bhakoto kunnobholela mundo ilebhe ipitile, peniya ajhakwalobholela mukupile mwana jwenio.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Bhando bhinkana Yecho ku Nachalete</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matei 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Yecho ajhakubhoka peniya alongohine na bhabholwa bhake na kujhenda ku muche gwake. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Lichiko lya Kupomolela pulihikita, Yecho akatumbwii kubhola munyumba jha kukonganikii Akayahude, bhando bhamahele bhibhannyokanikiya bhakahechwike. Bhajhakukonya, “Ghanga ghoha apatite ko? Ichima ghane jhapatite mundo hojho ade atende ilebhe ya kukangacha? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Bho, jhonjo mwana jwa mmacha mibhoko, mwana gwa Maliya na nnongo mundo Yakobu na Uchupo na Yuda na Simone? Bho, akalombo mundo bhabhii pambajhe na twenga?” Peniya bhajhakunchimwa na kunkana.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Nnondole jwa Chapanga bhanyokanikiya kila chehemo, nambo bhanyokanikiya ndeka pakilambo chake na akalongo bha kajha kwabhe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Yecho akatei ndeka ikangacho yoyoha pala, akabhekii mabhoko bhilwalwa bhandina, bhakalamite. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Yecho akakangiche nhwalo bhakibha jhe na kihobholelo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yecho ituma bhabholwa kome na bhabhele</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matei 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Peniya Yecho akajhahwii pachenda jhibhandikii na kubhola bhando. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Akakemite bhabholwa bhake kome na bhabhele, ajhakwatuma bhabhele bhabhele na kwapeke ukindendeke gwa kubhenga michuka. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Peniya ajhakwalobholela, “Pimijhenda nkoto kughegha kilebhe, nnyegha nkongocho. Nkoto kughegha chakulya, amu lihako, amu mbijha. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Uhwale maghubache, nkoto kughegha ngobho henge. <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Kabhele ajhakwalobholela nyumba jhojhoha jhipala kujhingila, ntame mwenio ade pupala kubhoka. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Pibhapala kukana kumpoke amu kunnyokanikiya, mmoke peniya na nkung'unde lutukunda lulubhii mumagholo ghino, kulangiya bhakanite lilobhe lya Chapanga!”<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Bhahe, bhakajhahwii kutangachii bhando bhauleka uhakaho na bhang'alambukile Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Bhakachomwii michuka twe. Bhakapakite mahuta bhibhalwalwa, bhajhakwalamicha.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhwe kwa Yohane Mbatichajhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matei 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Munahota nkolongwa Helode pajhohina malobhe gheniya gha chipwa jha Yecho itapakii. Bhando bhange bhakalongii, “Jhonjo Yohane Mbatichajhe ayokite! Ndi mana likakala lya ikangacho lihenga lihengo nkate jhake.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Bhange bhalongila, “Jhonjo ndi Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Na bhange bhalongila, “Jhonjo ndi jhumo jwa bhalondole bha Chapanga ngita milondole bha makacho.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Nambo Helode pajhohina malobhe, alongila, “Yohane Mbatichajhe nikahekite muto ayokite!,” <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Akawachii naha nhwalo machiko gheniya Helode jwenio akalaghalikiye Yohane bhantabhe mukipungo. Akatehi naha nhwalo gwa Helodiya nhwana mundo, jwakibha nhwana mundo Filipu, nnongo mundo Helode. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Machiko gheniya Yohane Mbatichajhe akankonyite Helode, “Chamaha jhe mwenga kuntolela mwikeghe jwa nnongo gwino.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Bhahe, Helodiya mwikeghe jwa munahota ajhakunchimwa Yohane na kupala kunkoma, nambo akahotwii ndeka. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Helode atehila kunyoghopa Yohane kwa mana akibha mundo jwatehila mambu gha umbone na nyahinyahi, bhahe, ajhakunnyemelela. Apalita kunyokanikiya, pajhomolila kunyokanikiya mwojho uminita hake.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Lichiko limo, mwikeghe jwa munahota Helodiya akapatite pwache jha unyagho gwa kubhelukwa Helode. Helode akabhatendile unyagho akanahota akakomana ngondo na akanahota bha kilambo cha ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Peniya nchikana jwa Helodiya pajhingila ajhakukina, ajhakuhanganicha Helode na akaghene bhake. Peniya munahota nkolongwa ajhakunnobholela mwana jwenio, “Unyope kilebhe chochoha chimipala, nanimpela.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Mala jha ubhele akalapanikiye, “Chochoha chimpala, ata nucho jha Unahota gwango.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Peniya nchikana jhola ajhakubhoka, na kunkonya majhe mundo, “Nyope kilebhe ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Na jwenio ajhakujhanguu, “Muto gwa Yohane Mbatichajhe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Nchikana jhola ajhakubhutuka ade kwa munahota nkolongwa, ajhakulonge, “Umbekehe muto gwa Yohane Mbatichajhe mukipalo!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Munahota Helode ajhakubhehe ngolongondi hake, akahotwii ndeka kukana, nambo nhwalo gwa kilapo chake palonge jha akaghene bhake. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Papalapala akannaghalikiye nkomana ngondo akajhahwii kukipungo, kunheketa muto gwa Yohane, <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>peniya ajhakuleta muto gwenio mukipalo, ajhakumpekiya nchikana jwenio, na jwenio ajhakukamuha majhe mundo. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Bhabholwa bha Yohane pibhajhohina gheniya, bhajhakutola yegha jhake, bhajhakuchika umambe.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho abhapeke chakulya bhando elufo nhwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matei 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohane 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Akatenga bhala bhajhakukelebhuka, bhakakonganike palonge jha Yecho, bhajhakunnobholela gheniya ghoha ghantei na kubhola. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Tujhende pakiyepela tukapomolele.” Alongila naha nhwalo pakibha na bhando bhamahele bhubhahikita na kubhoka, ade Yecho na bhabholwa bhake bhakapatitejhe pwache jha kulyegha. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Peniya, bhajhakubhoka mungalabha, bhajhakujhenda chehemo jhanga bhando.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Nambo bhando bhamahele bhajhakwabhona pibhabhokita, bhajhakumanya. Peniya bhajhakubhutuka kuhumii ku muche bhakatumbwii kuhika kabula jha Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Yecho na bhabholwa bhake pibhahulwika mungalabha, ajhakulibhona lilongo likolongwa lya bhando, ajhakwabhone kiya nhwalo bhabhonakina ngita mambelele ghangabhehe na nnuchajhe. Peniya ajhakwatumbuu kwabhola malobhe twe. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Pukihikita kimihe, bhabholwa bhake bhajhakunyende, bhajhakunobholela Yecho, “Pambano tubhii panjenga, na lyobha litipike. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Mwulitabhuke lilongo lya bhando leno bhajhende ku mighonda na chenda ibhandikile, bhakahemele yakulya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Nambo Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Mangota mapekehe yakulya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Bhajhakunkonya, “Bho, twapeke nike? Natupalwa kuhenga lihengo kwa miyehe jhamahele tipate mbijha ya kuhemela ilebhe ya kulyegha bhando bhamba?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Yecho ajhakwakonya, “Bho nkwete mabumunda maligha? Nnyende mukalinge.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Pubhamanyita, bhajhakunnobholela, “Tukwete mabumunda nhwano tugha na homba ibhele.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Peniya Yecho ajhakwalobholela bhabholwa bhake, mabhona bhando bhakatamite muibhogha ibhele, pamanyahe mabhehe. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Peniya bhajhakutama ibhoghaibhogha, apa makome kome na pala makome nhwano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Bhahe, Yecho akatoii mabumunda nhwano na homba ibhele, ajhakulola kunane, ajhakunchenguu Chapanga na ajhakumetula. Ajhakwapekeya bhabholwa bhake bhapeke bhando. Helahela bhajhakwahekete bhando bhoha homba. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Bhando bhoha bhakalile na kujhukuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Peniya bhabholwa bhake bhajhakujhola mahighiliko gha homba na mabumunda bhakatweli ichukilo kome na ibhele. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Akanalome bhubhalile bhakibha elufo nhwano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ityanga panane jha mache</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matei 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohane 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Peniya ajhakwalobholela bhabholwa bhake bhajhingile mungalabha bhalongolele ku Betisaida kwiye jha lilabha. Jwenio akibha atabhuka ibhogha ya bhando. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Pajhomolila kwatabhuka bhando, ajhakujhenda pakitombe kunyopa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Pukihikita kimihe, ngalabha ikibha pakate jha lilabha na Yecho akibha kanjika chake ndo mupele mwa lilabha. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Akamwene bhabholwa bhake pubhalaghita mungalabha, nhwalo upepo gwatobhita kanonoho. Puibhandikila kuchegha, Yecho ajhakwajhende, akibha atyanga panane jha mache, apata kwapeta. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Nambo bhene pibhamwene ityanga panane jha mache, bhajhakuwacha lihoka, bhajhakulalama. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Bhoha pibhamwene bhajhakujhoghopa hake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Papalapala Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Nkangamale! Ndi nenga. Nkotoka kujhoghopa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Peniya ajhakuhobhokela mungalabha jhikibha na bhabholwa bhake, na upepo ujhakuleka. Bhabholwa bhake bhakakangiche hake. <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>Nhwalo bhakamanyitejhe chakatehii Yecho panane jha libumunda lela, miojho jhabhe ikibha mijhundapaho.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ilamicha bhibhalwalwa kwenio ku Genechalete</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matei 14:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Bhajhakujhomboka lilabha bhajhakuhika ku kilambo cha ku Genechalete, bhajhakujhemeka ngalabha jhabhe. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Pibhapitita mungalabha, papalapala bhando bhajhakummanya Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Peniya bhajhakutindila kajhombe mukilambo choha, bhajhakutumbuu kwatola bhibhalwalwa mumipacha na kwapeleka popoha pubhajhohina Yecho abhii. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Na kila pajhahwila muchenda, ku miche amu ku mighonda, bhajhakwabheka bhibhalwalwa mu maghuliho. Bhangalwalwa bhajhakumpembelekeya Yecho bhapapae lilombolo lya ngobho jhake, bhoha bhibhakampapiye bhakalamite.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mabholo ghughapokwi kuhumii kwa akahokolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matei 15:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Lichiko limo Mapwalichayo na Bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo kuhumii ku Yeluchalemo, bhakajhahwii kwa Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Akahwene bhabholwa bhange bha Yecho bhalila changakuwa mache mu mabhoko ngita chilipata Lilaghalikilo lya Akayahude.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Nhwalo Mapwalichayo na Akayahude bhoha bhalyejhe changakuwa ade muhingongole, bhakakamwile mabholo ghubhapokii kuhumii kwa akahoko bhabhe. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Pubhahuma kulighuliho bhalyejhe kilebhe chochoha changakuwa ngita chibhakayobhalile. Helahela bhakakamwii mabholo ghange ghamahena gha kuchuka ikombe, ihulo na ibhegha.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Bhala Mapwalichayo na Bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo bhakankonyite Yecho, “Bho, bhabholwa bhino bhakengama ndeka mabholo kuhumii kwa ighogholo, bhalyegha kwa mabhoko mahakanaho?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Yecho ajhakwajhanguu, “Mangota mukitenda bhaumbone! Jwakibha nnondole jwa Chapanga Isaya akalondwi mangota ngita chajhandike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Bhando bhamba bhajhekete kwa milomo jhabhe tu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">nambo miojho jhabhe ibhii kutale na nenga.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Na bhene bhanyinamii jhajhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">Bhabhola Malaghalikilo gha bhando,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">ngita hela lilaghalikilo lya Chapanga!’<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>“Mulilekite lilaghalikilo lya Chapanga, mughakamuu malaghalikilo ghibhampekiye akahoko bhino.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Yecho ajhakujhendelela kulonge, “Nkwete ndela jhambone jha kukana malaghalikilo gha Chapanga nkamuu mabholo ghimpokii gha akahoko bhino! <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Ngita lilaghalikilo lya Mucha, ‘Majhokanikiye tate gwino na majhe gwino,’ na ‘Na jwannigha tate mundo amu majhe mundo, nabhankoma.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Mangota mwenga mibhola, anda mundo akwete kilebhe chakuntangati tate mundo amu majhe mundo, nambo alonge, ‘Kilebhe chenje Kolibane,’ mana jhake hupo jha kumpekeya Chapanga, <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>peniya yamaha ndeka kuntangati tate mundo amu majhe mundo. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Naha ndi chimulipucha lilobhe lya Chapanga kwa kukengama mabholo ghino mabhene. Na muhenga ghamahena ngita gheniya.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ilebhe intenda mundo kubhehe jwanganandela palonge jha miho gha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matei 15:10-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Peniya Yecho akalikemite kabhele lilongo lya bhando, ajhakwalobholela, “Mangota mwe bhoha unyokanikiye na umanye. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Kibhii jhe chakulyegha chalye mundo chikihotola kuntenda abhe na uhakaho. Nambo kilebhe chikimpeta mundo nkate, chenie ndi kintenda mundo abhe jwanganandela palonge jha Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>Mundo jwakwete machikilo gha kujhoha na abangatuke.”<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Palilekita lilongo lya bhando na kujhingii nkate, bhabholwa bhake bhajhakunkonya nnandanikiho gwenio. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Yecho ajhakwakonya, “Bho, mangota mwenga umanyite ndeka? Bho, umanya ndeka chakulyegha chikinnyingii mundo kuhumii panja ade kucholo kintenda ndeka kubhehe jwanganandela? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Nhwalo kijhingii ndeka kumwojho kijhingii kulutumbo, na kujhenda kucholo.” Kwa kulonge naha, Yecho ajhakulekekeya ilebhe yoha ilegwe.<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Yecho ajhakujhendelela kulonge, “Kilebhe chikimpita mundo, kintenda kubhe jwanganandela. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Nhwalo nkate jha mwojho gwa mundo, ghibhoka mawacho mahakaho na ngongola na lukwatulo na kukoma na wiho gwa ngongola, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>ughone na uwange na upichade na wiho na maligho na kuloka na lighoho na kutokomala. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Ghanga ghoha na uhakaho ghahuma nkate mwa mundo, na gheniya ghantenda mundo kubhehe na uhakaho palonge jha Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kihobholelo cha mwikeghe jhumo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matei 15:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Bhahe, Yecho ajhakupeta peniya na kujhenda ku kilambo cha ku Tilo. Kwenio ajhakujhingii nkate na akapahi jhe mundo amanye, nambo akahotwii ndeka kukihiya. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Peniya mwikeghe jhumo Nghilike jwakibha na mwana jhuna nchuka, akajhohine malobhe gha Yecho. Ajhakunnyendela, na kukigwiya pamagholo gha Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Mwikeghe jwenio akibha Nghilike chi Uyahude, jwabhelwike ku kilambo cha ku Chilofoinike, ajhakunnyopa Yecho amwohe mwana mundo nchuka. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Yecho ajhakujhanguu, “Mwaleke yana ijhukute. Yamaha ndeka kutola chakulya chibhalye yana na kukitaghii ghimbwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Majhe jhola ajhakujhanguu, “Chakaka, Bhambo, nambo ghimbwa ibhii kuhi pa mecha ilye mahighililo gha yana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Yecho ajhakunnobholela, “Mwikeghe jhola, kwa gheniya ghunnyangwile, nnyende kajha. Nchuka ghummokite mwana!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Bhahe, mwikeghe ajhakujhenda kajhake ku Galilaya kupete ku Dekapoli, ajhakunkolela mwana agholwike pakindanda, na nchuka ummokite.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho inamicha jwangalongela na jwanga jhoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Peniya Yecho pabhokita ku kilambo cha ku Tilo, kupete ku Sidone, kuhika kulilabha lya ku Galilaya kupete ku kilambo cha Miche Kome. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Bhando bhange bhakannetite mundo jwangajhoha machikilo na jhuna kimama, bhajhakunyopa Yecho amekele mabhoko anamiche. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Peniya Yecho ajhakumeka kutale na lilongo lya bhando na kujhingii ngonje mu machikilo gha mundo jwangajhoha. Peniya ajhakuhuna mata pahe na kupapaa lulime lwa mundo jhola. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Peniya Yecho ajhakulolekeya kunane kwa Chapanga, ajhakutweta kwa likakala ajhakulonge, “Efata,” mana jhake, “Dinduka!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Papalapala machikilo gha mundo jhola ghajhakudinduka, lulime lwake lujhakulegheleka, ajhakutumbuu kulonge maha. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Peniya Yecho ajhakwalaghalikiya bhakoto kunongelela mundo jhojhoha ghighapitile. Pachochita kwakanikiya, bhajhakujhendelela kutangacha malobhe gheniya. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Bhando bhakakangiche hake, bhakalongii, “Atei ghoha ghambone. Bhangajhoha hilu machikilo bhajhoha, na bhina kimama bhalonge!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yecho abhalicha bhando elufo ncheche</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matei 15:32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Machiko gheniya, lilongo likolongwa lya bhando likakonganike kabhele. Nhwalo bhakibha jhe na ilebhe ya kulyegha, Yecho ajhakwakema bhabholwa bhake, ajhakwalobhalela, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“Nakole kiya bhando bheniya, hena, bhatamite na nenga kwa machiko matato changalyegha. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Nalobholila bhajhende kajhabhe na njala bhihoto kuhindukii undela, nhwalo bhange bhahuma kutale.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Bhabholwa bhake bhajhakunkonya, “Bho, pamba palundwanga nabhapata ko chakulyegha kujhukuta bheniya bhoha?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Yecho ajhakwakonya, “Bho, nkwete mabumunda malegha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Bhajhakunyanguu, “Tubhii nagho chaba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Bhahe, Yecho ajhakwalobholela mwatamike bhando pahe. Ajhakutola mabumunda chaba ajhakunchenguu Chapanga, ajhakumetula na kwapekeya bhabholwa bhake bhaghabhanichile bhando, na bhene bhajhakwabhaghulila bhando. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Helahela bhakibha na homba yandina. Yecho ajhakuilomba na kwalobholela bhabholwa bhake bhabhaghulile bhando. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Bhando bhakalile na kujhukuta, peniya bhabholwa bhake bhajhakulokota mahighililo gha mabumunda na homba, bhajhakutweleya ichukilo chaba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Bhando bhubhalila bhakibha ngita elufo ncheche. Peniya Yecho ajhakwatabhuka. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Papalapala ajhakujhingii mungalabha na bhabholwa bhake, ajhakujhenda ku kilambo chuku Dalimanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mapwalichayo bhipala nginyililo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matei 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matei 16:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Mapwalichayo bhange bhajhakunyendelela Yecho, na kutumbuu kutaungana nako, bhajhakunnyigha bhapata nginyililo kuhumii kunane kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Yecho ajhakubhehe ngolongondi, akalongii, “Nhwalo ghane kibheluko chenje kipala nginyililo chakaka ninnobholela, nakipelwajhe nginyililo jhojhoha.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Peniya ajhakwaleka, ajhakujhingii mungalabha, ajhakujhomboka kwiye mulilabha lya ku Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngedule jha Mapwalichayo na Helode</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matei 16:5-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Bhabholwa bhajhakujhehwa kughegha mabumunda ghamahele, nambo bhakibha na libumunda limo mungalabha. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Mukilolekehe na ngedule ya Mapwalichayo na jha Helode.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Bhabholwa bhajhakutumbuu kutaungana bhene kwa bhene, “Alongila naha nhwalo tukwete ndeka mabumunda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Yecho akamanyite chibhakibha bhalongila. Ajhakwakonya, “Bho, mutaungana nhwalo gwa mabumunda? Bho, mwamela mwangamanya? Bho, miwacha jhe ku mwojho? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Mina miho mulo ndeka, mina machikilo mujhoha ndeka? Bho, mikombokajhe, <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>pumetwila mabumunda nhwano na kwapekeya bhando elufo nhwano? Bho, mukatweli ichukilo ilegha ya mahighiliko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Bhajhakunyanguu, “Tukatwelii itandabhala kome na ibhele.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>Jwenio ajhakwakonya kabhele, bho, “Pumetwila mabumunda chaba na kwapekiya bhando elufo ncheche, mukatweli ichukilo ilegha ya mahighiliko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Bhajhakunyanguu, “Ichukilo chaba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Bhahe, ajhakwakonya, “Mwamela minamanyajhe?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho alamicha mundo jwangalola kwenio ku Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Yecho akahikite ku Betichaida pamonga na bhabholwa bhake. Bhando bhange bhajhakumpelekela Yecho mundo jwangalola, bhajhakumpembelekeya ampapahe anamiche. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Yecho ajhakunkamuu lubhoko lwa mundo jwangalola, ajhakumpiya panja jha chenda. Peniya ajhakuhunii mata kumiho, ajhakumekela mabhoko, ajhakunkonya, “Bho, mwihoto kulola kilebhe chochoha?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Jwangalola ajhakulola na peniya ajhakulonge, “Nibhona bhando anda mikongo chityanga.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Yecho ajhakummeke kabhele mabhoko pamiho jha mundo jwenio. Peniya miho ghajhakudinduka na jwenio ajhakulola maha. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Yecho ajhakunnobholela, abhujhe kajhake na ajhakunkanakiya kujhingii muchenda na kwalobholela bhando.<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petile ilonge hotuhotu Yecho ndi Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matei 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Yecho na bhabholwa bhake bhajhakujhenda ku chenda jha ku Kaisaliya jha ku Filipu. Undela Yecho ajhakwakonya, “Bho, bhando bhalonge nenga ndi ghane?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Bhajhakunyanguu, “Bhange bhalonge mwenga mwa Yohane Mbatichajhe, na bhange bhalonge mwenga mwa Eliya, na bhange bhalonge mwenga ndi ma Nnondole jwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Peniya Yecho ajhakwakonya, “Mangota milonge nenga ndi ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petile ajhakunyanguu, “Mwenga ndi mwa Kilichitu, jhuhagulilwe na Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Yecho ajhakwapwatalila, “Nkotoka kunnobholela mundo jhojhoha malobhe ghanga.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ilongele kulagha na kuwe na kuyoka kwake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matei 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Yecho ajhakutumbuu kwabhola bhabholwa bhake, ajhakwalobholela, “Mwana gwa Mundo nalunkolela lung'ahe lukolongwa na kukanwa na akanahota na akapiya matambiko bhakolo na Bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo. Nabhankoma, na machiko matato anda ghahikite peniya nayoka.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela hotuhotu. Peniya, Petile ajhakuntola Yecho paupele, ajhakutumbuu kumpwatalila nkoto kulonge naha. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Nambo Yecho ajhakughalambuka, ajhakwalolekeya bhabholwa bhake, ajhakumpwatali Petile alongila, “Mmoke palonge jhango mwenga ma limbembela! Nhwalo miwacha ndeka gha Chapanga, nambo miwacha kimundo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Peniya ajhakulikema lilongo lya bhando pamonga na bhabholwa bhake, ajhakwalobholela, “Mundo jhojhoha jwapala kubhehe na nenga akihila hote jwenio, atole nchalaba gwake, angengame. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Mana mundo jwapala kuughombola ughome gwake jwenio, nahuhobholela, mundo jwahobhecha ughome gwake nhwalo gwa nenga kwa Malobhe gha Mbone, naukombola. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Bho, Nakitangatila nike mundo kupata nnema ghoha na kuhobheya ughome gwa machiko ghoha? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Mundo napiha nike kupoke ughome gwa machiko ghoha kabhele? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Mundo anda amwone hone nenga na Malobhe ghango mu kibheluko changanandela na ngongola, Mwana gwa Mundo namonela hone papala kuhika muukolo gwa tate pamo na akatumiche bha Chapanga jwa kunane bhanyahinyahi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Yecho ajhakujhendelela kwalobholela, “Ninobholela chakaka, bhabhii bhando bhange pambano pano nabhawejhe kabula jha kubhona Unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga ukahika na likakala.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho aghalambuka kumiho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matei 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Pighapetita machiko chita, Yecho ajhakwatola Petile na Yakobu na Yohane, panane jha kitombe kanjika chabhe. Kwenio Yecho ajhakughalambuka ubhonekano pamiho palonge jhabhe. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Magwanda ghake ajhakung'anyima mbumbumbu, mupula ngobho jhojhoha pannema ahoto ndeka kupula ngita yenio. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Eliya na Mucha bhajhakupiti palonge jhabhe, na kulonge na Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Petile ajhakunnobholela Yecho, “Mmola, nibhona pambano pambone hake kutama twenga. Mbaha tuchenge ichimba itato, chimo chino, chimo cha Mucha na chimo cha Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Na jwenio Petile na ajhake bhakajhogwipe hake ata Petile akamanyitejhe cha kulonge.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Peniya likahikite lihunde, na lijhakwayekelela, na lilobhe lijhakujhokanikika kuhumii kulihunde lyenio, “Jhonjo ndi Mwanango jhunimpahile, munyokanikiye!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Peniya bhabholwa bhajhakulolekeana kabhele, bhakamwene ndeka mundo, Yecho kanjika chake pamonga nabho.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Bhahe, pibhahelila kukitombe, Yecho ajhakwakanakiya bhakotoka kunnobholela mundo jhojhoha ilebhe ibhaihwene, ade Mwana gwa Mundo papala kuyoka.<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Bhahe, bhakakamwii lilaghalikilo lyenio, bhajhakukonyana, bhene kwa bhene, “Kuyoka mana jhake nike?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Bhabholwa bhajhakunkonya Yecho, “Bho, bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo bhilonge ade Eliya ahike?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Na jwenio Yecho ajhakwajhanguu, “Chakaka, Eliya ahika kutengenecha ghoha. Peniya, kwa nhwalo ghane ijhandikwe mu Majhandiko gha Chapanga Mwana gwa Mundo chapata malagho twe na kupuchwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Nambo ninnobholela mangota, Eliya ahikite njwe, na jwenio bhakantendi chibhapata ngita chijhandikwe panane jhake.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho inamicha kangombo jhuna nchuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matei 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Yecho na bhabholwa bhala bhatato, bhajhakubhujha pubhabhii bhange, bhajhakulibhona lilongo likolongwa litindile na Bhabhola bhange bha Malaghalikilo bhakibha mukutaungana nabho. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Papalapala lilongo lya bhando pubhamonita Yecho, bhakakangiche hake, bhajhakumutukila bhanyambuche. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Yecho ajhakwakonya bhabholwa bhake, “Bho, mutaungana nike?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Peniya mundo jhumo kuhumii mulilongo ajhakunyanguu, “Mmola, ninetite mwana gwango kwino, jhuna nchuka jhulindenda akoto kulonge. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Pahika na kuchikilwa, ung'wiya pahe na kuntenda apite lihulohulo munnomo, ayagha mino na kujhoma chwa yegha. Nakajhopite bhabholwa bhino bhabhohe nchuka, nambo bhakahotwi ndeka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Mangota kibheleko changabhehe na kihobholelo! Nandama na mangota ade ligha? Nanihimbilila ade ligha? Munnete kwa nenga!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Bhajhakumpeleka kangombo jwenio kwa Yecho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Nchuka pamonita Yecho, ajhakuntenda kangombo kihinduhindu, na kangombo ajhakugwe pahe ajhakuyolayola, na kupita lihulohulo munomo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yecho ajhakunkonya tate gwa kangombo, “Ghanga ghankoli kuhumii legha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Na jwenio ajhakunyanguu, “Kuhuma umwana gwake. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>nchuka gwenio ugwiya kangombo hojho pakihinja na umache unkome. Bhahe, anda uhoto, mutubhone kiya na mututangatile.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yecho ajhakunnobholela, “Nkoto kulonge ngita nihoto! Ghoha ghiwechekana kwa mundo jwabhii na kihobholelo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Peniya, tate mundo jwenio ajhakulela kanonoha, “Nihobholela! Nambo kihobholelo chango kitocha ndeka, undangatile!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yecho palilolokiya lilongo lya bhando lijhonjekeka kajhombe palonge jhake, ajhakupwatalila nchuka ghola, “Nchuka jhumutenda kangombo jhonjo kuhoto ndeka kulonge na jwangajhoha machikilo, nimenga, muneke kangombo jhonjo na kunyingii jhe kabhele!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Peniya nchuka ujhakulalama, ujhakugwiya na kuntenda kangombo kihinduhindu, na kumoka. Kangombo ajhakubhonekana ngita atehi kuwegha, na bhange bhalongela, “Awile!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Peniya, Yecho ajhakunkamuu lubhoko kangombo, ajhakuntangatila kujhinula, na jwenio ajhakujhema.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Bhahe, Yecho pajhingila nkate, bhabholwa bhake bhajhakunkonya, “Bho, nhwalo gwa nike twenga tukahotwi ndeka kubhenga nchuka?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Nchuka ngita ghongo nhoto ndeka kubhoka ade kwa kunnyopa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ilonge kabhele kuwe kwake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matei 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Yecho na bhabholwa bhajhakubhoka, kujhendelela na mwanja gwabhe kupete ku kilambo cha ku Galilaya. Yecho akapahi jhe bhando bhange bhamanye pabhile, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>nhwalo akibha abholita bhabholwa bhake. Ajhakwalobholela, “Mwana gwa Mundo nabhankamuha mu mabhoko gha bhando na kunkoma. Nambo lichiko lya utato kubhoka mukuwegha nayoka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Nambo bhabholwa bhake bhakamanyitejhe nhwalo gwenio. Bhajhakunyoghopa kunkonya.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ghane jwabhii nkolongwa?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matei 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Bhahe, bhajhakuhika ku kilambo cha ku Kapelenaumo, na pakibha kajhake, Yecho ajhakwakonya bhabholwa bhake, “Nkomanila nike undela?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Bhene bhajhakukotoka, undela bhataungina ndi ghane jwabhii nkolongwa pakate jhabhe. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Yecho ajhakutama pahe, ajhakwakema bhabholwa bhake kome na bhabhele, ajhakwalobholela, “Mundo jwapala kubhehe nkolongwa nabhaha jwandina na kubhehe ntumiche jha bhoha.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Bhahe, Yecho ajhakuntola mwana jwandina ajhakunkumbatila, ajhakujhemeka pakate jhabhe, na kwalobholela, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>“Jwampoke mwana ngita jhonjo kwa liina lyango, ambokii nenga. Na jwamboke nenga, ambokii nenga tujhe, ampoke jwandumita.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundo jhojhoha jwangakana abhii pamo na twenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Yohane ajhakunnobholela Yecho, “Bhambo, tunkolile mundo abhenga michuka kwa liina lino na twenga tujhakunkelebhuha nhwalo jwenio abhii jhe pamonga na twenga.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Yecho ajhakulonge, “Nkotoka kunkelebhuha, mana abhii jhe mundo jwahoto kuhenga gha kukangacha kwa liina lyango, na papa na kuhoto kulonge ghanganandela kwa nenga. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Nhwalo mundo jhojhoha jwangatukana, jwenio nnyito. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Ninobholela chakaka, mundo jhojhoha jwampekeya kibaba cha mache gha kunywegha, nhwalo mwenga ndi mundo jwa Kilichitu, chakaka nampokela ndweko yake.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwahobhecha bhange</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matei 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>“Mundo jhojhoha jwapala kuhobhecha jhumo jwa bhamba bhana bhibhahobholela bhatende jwahenge uhakaho, mbaha kwa mundo jwenio kuntabhalila lwalwa pantandala na kuntaghii kumbwane kuliku malagho gha Chapanga lichiko lyenio. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Lubhoko lwino anda luhobhecha kuhenga uhakaho, mbaha kuluheketa. Mbaha kujhingii mu ughome na lubhoko lumo, kuliku kujhingii mumwotu gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta na mabhoko ghino. <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>Mwenio hunye ihwejhe mumwotu gwake uhimikajhe. <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Anda lugholo luhobhecha kuhenga uhakaho, mbaha kuluheketa. Mbaha kujhingii mu ughome na lugholo lumo. Kuliku kujhingii na magholo mabhele mumwotu gwa machiko ghoha. <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Mwenio, hunye yake ihwe ndeka na mwotu gwake uhimajhe. <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Na liho lino anda luhobhecha, mulibhohe! Mbaha kujhingii mu unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga mmii na liho limo, kuliku kubhehe na miho mabhele na kutaghwa mu mwotu gwa machiko ghoha. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Mwenio hunye yake ihwejhe, na mwotu uhimika jhe.<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>“Kila mundo najhelebhuka kwa mwinyo ngita kipeka pibhaleke mu mwotu.<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>“Mwinyo gwambone, anda uhobhecha kunogha kwake, nabhalekela nike ade unoghe kabhele?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Mme na mwinyo gwa ukoche pakate jhino na ntame kwa uteeke.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yecho abhola mabholo gha kutolela na kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matei 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:-1-18">Luka 16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Yecho ajhakubhoka pachenda na kujhenda ku Yudeya, ajhakujhomboka kwiye mulukemba lwa ku Yolodane. Lilongo lya bhando lijhakunyendela kabhele, na jwenio ajhakwabhola kabhele ngita chayobhalile.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Bhahe, Mapwalichayo bhange bhajhakunyendelela Yecho kwa kunyambila bhajhakunkonya, “Bho, Lilaghalikilo lya Chapanga lijheketela munalome kuneka nhwana mundo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Yecho ajhakwajhanguu, “Bho, Mucha akanaghalikiye nike?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Na bhene bhajhakulonge, “Mucha akalaghalikiye munalome anyandikila baluwa na kunneka nhwana gwino.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Mucha akajhandikile Lilaghalikilo lyenio nhwalo gwa kujhundupa kwa kubholekeka kwino. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Nambo Mucha akajhandike, kuhumii mukupangana nnema Chapanga akapangine munalome na mwikeghe. <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>‘Peniya, munalome nanneka tate mundo na majhe mundo, nabhabha pamo, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>na bhene bhabhele nabhabha yegha jhimo. Na bhabhele kabhejhe, nabhabha yegha jhimo’ <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Bhahe, chalombaniche Chapanga, abhii jhe mundo jwakulekanicha.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Pibhajhingila nkate munyumba, bhabholwa bhake bhajhakunkonya nhwalo gwa lilobhe lyenio. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Na Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Mundo jhojhoha jwaneka nhwana mundo na kutolela mwikeghe jhonge, atende ngongola nhwana mundo. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Na helahela mwikeghe jwanneka ungana mundo na kutolelwa na jhonge atende ngongola ungana mundo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho aikuchulila yana ichokombe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matei 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Bhando bhange bhajhakunete Yecho yana ichokombe aipapahe, bhabholwa bhake bhajhakwipwatalila. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Yecho pabhonita gheniya, ajhakuyoma, ajhakwalobholela, “Muileke yana ihike kwa nenga, mangaibhilikiya, nhwalo Unahota gwa Chapanga ndi kwa bhando bhubhabhii ngita yana. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Ninobholela chakaka, mundo jhojhoha jwangapoke Unahota gwa Chapanga ngita yana ichokombe, nanyingii ng'o mwenio.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Peniya ajhakwapokela yana yenio, ajhakwabhekela mabhoko, na kuikuchulila kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundo jwabhii na ilebhe twe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matei 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Yecho patumbwila kabhele mwanja gwake, mundo jhumo ajhakunhikilila lubhelo, ajhakutama makilikite palonge jhake, ajhakunkonya, “Mmola jwambone, ndende nike mme na ughome gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yecho ajhakunyanguu, “Bho, ungema nenga naumbone? Abhii jhe jwaumbone nga Chapanga kanjika chake. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Mulimanyite maha lilaghalikilo, ‘Nkotoka kutenda ngongola amu nkotoka kukoma amu nkotoka kujhibha amu nkotoka kulonge uwange na nkotoka kukopokeya na bhajhokanikiya tate gwino na majhe gwino.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Na mundo jwenio ajhakunyanguu, “Mmola, gheniya ghoha nighakamwii punikibha nakangombo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yecho ajhakunnolekeya, ajhakumpala, ajhakunnobholela, “Kipongwike kilebhe chimo. Nnyende mukachuluche ilebhe hino inkwete, mbijha makabhaghulile akahocho, na mwenga namaha na kihukilo kunane. Peniya ndi uhika ungengame.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Paijhohine gheniya, ajhakuhechuka na kubhoka kongo abhii ngolongondi, nhwalo akibha mundo jhuna ilebhe twe, akapahi jhe kubhoha ilebhe yake.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Yecho ajhakulinga koha, ajhakwalobholela bhabholwa bhake, “Naibhaha kujhundupa kwa mundo jwabhii na ilebhe twe kumpekehe Chapanga anongoche ughome munahota nkolongwa gwake!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Bhabholwa bhake bhakakangiche malobhe ghake. Yecho ajhakwalobholela kabhele, “Yana yango, chakaka kujhundupa kujhingii mu nahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Ndi ijhojwike kwa kinyama chikikemwa ngamiya kuholota pa lihoto lwa luchungulo lwa mpacha, kuliku jwabhii na ilebhe twe kujhingii mu Unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga!” <figure style="fig" alt="A camel" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" ref="10:25">Kinyama chikikemwa ngamiya</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Bhabholwa bhake bhakakangiche hake bhajha kukonyana, “Ndi ghane bhahe, bho, ghane ngohe nahotola kughombokoka?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yecho ajhakwalolekeya, ajhakwalongelela, “Kwa mundo iwechekana jhe, kwa Chapanga naha ndeka, nambo kwa Chapanga ghoha ghiwechekana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Peniya Petile ajhakunobholela, “Dolekeya! Na twenga bho? Ghoha tughalekite, tunkengime mwenga!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yecho ajhakunnobholela, “Ninobholela chakaka, kila mundo jwalekite nyumba, na nnongo mundo na nnombo mundo na majhe mundo na tate mundo na yana mundo na mighonda jhake nhwalo gwa nenga na Malobhe gha Mbone, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>napokela mbwe ngoheno. Nyumba na akalongo na nnombo na majhe na yana na mighonda pamonga na malagho, na palonge nabhaha na ughome gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Bhamahena bhibhawacha akanahota bha ngoheno nabhabha akachokombe, bhakujhomolela nabhabhaha bhakutumbula.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho alonge jha utato kuwe na kuyoka kwake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matei 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Bhahe, bhabholwa bhake bhakibha undela kuhobhoka ku Yeluchalemo. Yecho ajhakwalobholela bhabholwa bhake bhakibha na bwaghaliya na bhando bhubhakengima na bhene bhakibha na bwaghaliya helahela. Yecho ajhakwatola bhabholwa panga bhando, ajhakutumbuu kwalongelela ghighapala kunkolela. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Ajhakwalobholela, “Unyokanikiye, tujhenda ku Yeluchalemo, na kwenio Mwana gwa Mundo nabhankamuha kwa akapiya matambiko bhakolo na bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo. Na bhene nabhahadabulwa bhankome na kunkamuya kwa bhando bha ilambo henge. <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>Na bhene nabhankinila na kuhunii mata na kunkuna yato na kunkoma. Nambo lichiko lya utato nayoka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu na Yohane bhannyopa kilebhe Yecho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matei 20:20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Peniya Yakobu na Yohane, yana mundo Chebedayo, bhajhakunjhendela Yecho, na kunobholela, “Mmola, tupala mututendele kilebhe chitupala kunyopa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Yecho ajhakwakonya, “Mipala nintendele nike mangota?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Bhabholwa bhajhakujhanguu, “Pipala kutama pakigoda chino cha Unahota nkolongwa na ung'alicho gwino, tupala kutama na mwenga, jhumo lubhoko lwalelo na jhonge lubhoko lwa ngejha.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Umanyite jhe chimujhopa. Bho, mihotola kunywegha mukibaba cha malagho chininywegha nenga, amu kubatichwa ubaticho ngita ghunibatichwa nenga?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Bhala bhabholwa bhajhakujhanguu, “Tuhotola.” Yecho ajhakwalobhalela, “Komiche jhimbala kunywegha naunywaha kwele, na mbatichwa ubaticho ngita chinibatichwa nenga. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Ndi ghane jwapala kubhehe kwa lelo amu kwa ngejha kwango. Nambo napwache jhango ndeka kupanga, nabhapelwa bhibhapangilwe na Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Bhala bhabholwa bhange kome pibhajhohina chibhajhopita, bhajhakutumbuu kwachimwa Yakobu na Yohane. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Bhahe, Yecho ajhakwakema bhoha na kwalobholela, “Umanye bhala bhibhabhonekana bhakolo kwa bhando bha ilambo henge bhilongocha kwa likakala. Bhakolo bheniya bhina uhotolo ghoha kwa bhando bhabhe. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Nambo kwino mangota nahi jhe, jwapala kubhehe nkolongwa pakate jhino, abhehe ntumiche gwino. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Jwapala kubhehe nkolongwa kupeta bhoha, ipalwa abhaha ntumiche jwabhoha. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Mwana gwa Mundo, ahikitejhe kuhengelwa, nambo ahikite kwahengela, na kubhoha ughome gwake kwakombola bhando bhoha.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho anamicha jwangalola jwankemitwa Batulumayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matei 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Bhahe, bhakahikite ku Yeliko, na jwenio Yecho na bhabholwa bhake na lilongo lya bhando libhokita kumuche, mundo jhumo jwangalola jwankemitwa Batulomayo mwana gwa Timayo, atamita mupele mwa ndela kujhopajhopa. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Pajhohina Yecho jwa ku Nachalete atehila kupeta peniya, ajhakutumbuu kunonoha lilobhe, “Yecho! Mwana gwa Daude, umonele kiya!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Bhando bhamahele bhajhakumpwatalila na kunnobholela akotoke, jwenio ajhakuchocha kunonoha lilobhe, “Mwana gwa Daude, umonele kiya!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Yecho ajhakujhema, kulonge, “Munobholele ahike.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Bhahe, bhajhakunkema jwangalola, bhajhakunobholela, “Nkangamale mwojho! Jhema, ankema.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Na jwenio ajhakutaghii kutale ngobho yake, ajhakuhomba, ajhakunnyendela Yecho.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yecho ajhakunkonya, “Mipala nintendele nike?” Jwangalola ajhakunnobholela, “Mmola, nijhopa kulola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yecho ajhakunobholela, “Nnyende, kihobholelo chino kinamiche.” Papalapala jwangalola ajhakulola na kunkengama Yecho.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yecho ajhingii ku Yeluchalemo kwa ilulo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matei 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohane 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Yecho na bhabholwa bhake pibhabhandikila kuhika ku Yeluchalemo bhajhakuhika ku Betifage na ku Betaniya, bhakabhandikii pakitombe cha ku Micheitune. Yecho ajhakwatuma bhabholwa bhake bhabhele, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>ajhakwalobholela, “Nnyende muchenda imuibhona. Na pumujhingila mu chenda yenio, namumona litole lya liponda bhalikongile, lyamela anatumbu jhe kutami mundo. Na mulibhopole na nhwike nalyo pamba. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Anda mundo ankonyite, ‘Bho, mikabhopola?’ Munnobholele, ‘Bhambo ampala namujhicha kabhele ngoheno.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Bhahe, bhajhakujhenda, bhajhakunkolela kaponda bhakakongii pa nnyango gwa nyumba pandela. Pibhabhopwila, <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>bhando bhubhakibha bhajhemite peniya bhajhakwakonya, “Nhwalo gwa nike mukabhopo kaponda?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Bhabholwa bhakajhangwii ngita Yecho chakabhalobhalile, na bhando bhala bhajhakwaleka bhajhende nako. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Bhabholwa bhajhakumpelekela Yecho kaponda. Bhajhakujhala ngobho yabhe panane jha liponda na Yecho ajhakuhobhokela na kutama panane jhake. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Bhando bhamahele bhajhakujhala ngobho yabhe mundela, bhange bhajhakujhala matuto gha mikongo ghibhakapengwii kumighonda. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Bhando bhoha bhibhakalongalile na bhibhankengima, bhajhakunonoha malobhe ghabhe bhalongela, “Ulombo kwa Chapanga! Tuhanganile jwenio jwahika kwa liina lya Bhambo! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Ghuna mota unahota nkolongwa ghuhika gwa tate gwito Daude. Ulombo kwa Chapanga jwa kunane!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yecho ajhakujhingii kubomane jha ku Yeluchalemo ajhakujhenda ade mu Nyumba jha Chapanga, ajhakulingukiya kila kilebhe. Nhwalo ikibha kimihe, ajhakujhenda ku Betaniya pamonga na bhabholwa bhake kome na bhabhele.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho aulapanikii nkongo nkojho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matei 21:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Lukela jhake, pubhabhokita ku Betaniya, Yecho ajhakubhona njala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Bhahe, ajhakubhona nkongo gwa nkojho chakutale ubhii na mahamba ghamahena ajhakuheghelela alinge pange upambike uhohe. Pauheghelila, akaukoli upambike ndeka nga mahamba tugha, ukahikite ndeka muda gwa kupambika. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Peniya ajhakuulongelela nkongo ghola, “Kutumbulii deleno na machiko ghoha mundo jhojhoha nalyejhe uhohe kuhumii munkongo hogho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Na bhabholwa bhake bhakajhohine malobhe gheniya.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ajhingii munyumba jha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matei 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohane 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Bhahe, bhakahikite ku Yeluchalemo, Yecho ajhakujhingii mu Nyumba jha Chapanga na kutumbuu kwabhenga bhando panja bhibhachulwicha na kuhemela ilebhe mwenio. Ajhakupendengula njangwale ya bhando bhala bhubhakibha bhajhangangina mbijha, na igoda ya bhala bhibhachulwicha ngunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Akabhakanakii bhando kupeta ndeka pulubhanja jwakapitite na kilebhe chochoha mu Nyumba jha Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Peniya ajhakwabhola, “Ijhandikwe, ‘Nyumba jhango nahibha nyumba jha kunnyope Chapanga kwa bhando bha ilambo yoha.’ Mangota mwenga uyohite nkwembe gwa kukwatulila ilebhe!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Akapiya matambiko bhakolo na bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo pibhajhohina gheniya, bhakatumbwii kupalaha kihokola chakupala kunkoma. Bhakajhogwipe nhwalo gwa lilongo lya bhando ghukangicha mabholo ghake.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Pikihikita kimihe, Yecho na bhabholwa bhake bhakabhokite ku bomane.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabholo gha nkongo ghujhomite</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matei 21:20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Putiputi, pubhapetita, bhajhakubhona nkongo gwa nkojho ghola ujhomite chwaa, mikegha ade kukilegheleghe chake. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Petile akaukombwike nkongo ghola, ajhakunobholela Yecho, “Mmola, dolekeya! Nkojho ghola ghumulapanikiya, ujhomite!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Muhobholele Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Ninobholela chakaka, mundo anda akilobholile kitombe chenje heghela hoko, mukitaghile kumbwane, changakiholo ku mwojho gwake, anda ahobholela ghoha ghalongii naghatendeka, natendelwa kilebhe i. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Nambo ninobholela, piminyopa kilebhe chochoha Chapanga, na unhobholela nampokela. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Pimijhema na kunnyopa Chapanga, tunnekekehe kila mundo jwalemwite, Tate gwito jwa kunane kwa Chapanga nanekekeya na mangota hele ghunemwite. <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Nambo changalekekeya bhange bhibhalemwite, na Tate gwino jwa kunane nannekekeya ndeka mangota mwe ghinnemwite.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhando bhakonya uhotolo gwa Yecho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matei 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Bhahe, bhajhakuhika kabhele ku Yeluchalemo. Yecho pakibha atyangita pa Nyumba jha Chapanga, akapiya matambiko bhakolo, bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo na ighogholo bhajhakunyendelela, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>bhajhakunkonya Yecho, “Bho, mihenga ghanga kwa ukindendeke gwa ghane? Na ghane jwampekiye mwenga ukindendeke gwa kuhenga gheniya?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Nipala kunkonya kilebhe chimo. Anda unyangwii, na nenga naninobholela nihenga ilebhe henge kwa ukindendeke gwa ghane. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Bho, ukindendeke gwa Yohane gwa kubaticha uhumita ko, kunane kwa Chapanga amu kwa bhando? Unyangule.”<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Bhajhakutumbuu kukonyana, “Anda tulongii, ‘Ghahuma kwa Chapanga,’ nalongela, ‘Bho, nhwalo ghane mukajheketii ndeka?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Akakolo bha matambiko na bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo anda tulongii, ‘Uhumita kwa bhando,’ naibha bho?” Bhakalijhogwipe lilongo lya bhando bhakamanyite chakaka Yohane akibha Nnondole jwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Bhahe, bhajhakunnyanguu Yecho, “Twenga timanyitejhe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Na jwenio Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Na nenga naninobholela ndeka nihenga ghanga kwa ukindendeke gwa ghane.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Nnandanikiho gwa nghonda gwa michabibo na jwailema</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matei 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Yecho ajhakutumbuu kulonge nabho kwa nnandanikiho alongila, Mundo jhumo akalemite nng'onda gwa michabibo. Ajhakutindikiya ubhegho, na pakate jhake ajhakutengenecha chehemo jha kuminyii chabibo, ajhakuchenga kichimba cha ulendo. Ajhakujhahikicha nghonda gwenio kwa bhando bhange, na kujhenda ku kilambo cha kutale.<figure style="fig" alt="Two people pressing grapes in a winepress" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" ref="12:1">Bhando bhabhele bhiminya chabibo</figure> <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Pughahikita machiko gha mahuno, akantumite ntumiche gwake kwa bhala bhubhajhahike mighonda, akannetee chehemo jha mahuno gha nghonda gwake. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Bhubhalema bhala bhajhakunkamuu ntumiche jhola, na bhajhakuntyala, bhajhakumenga mabhoko matopo. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Akantumite kabhele ntumiche jhonge. Jwenio bhajhakunkamuu na kuntende ilebhe ya kunnete hone ade kunkocholana muto. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Peniya nkolo nghonda ajhakuntuma kabhele ntumiche jhonge na bhubhajhahikichwe mighonda bhajhakunkoma na jwenio. Na bhange bhamahele bhibhakatumitwe, bhakabhujhite jhe na bhange bhakakomitwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Pakahighilile na mundo jhumo, mwana jwampala. Na kujhomolela kwake ajhakuntuma jwenio alongila, Nabhanendema mwanango. <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>“Na bheniya bhubhalema bhajhakupwepelana, ‘Jhonjo ndi nabhujhila mighonda, bhahe, tunkome nghonda gwake ubhehe gwito!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Na jwenio bhajhakunkamuu, na kunkoma na kuntaghii kutale jha mighonda jha chabibo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>“Bhahe, nkolo nghonda natenda bho? Chahika kwakoma bhubhalema na kujhahikicha nng'onda gwenio gwa michabibo kwa bhando bhange. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Bho, nchomitejhe Majhandiko ghanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Lighanga libhalikanite mapunde kuchenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">na ngoheno libhii lighanga likolo lya nchinge.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Bhambo ndi jwatehi kilebhe chenje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">na lyenio lya kukangacha kwito!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Akapiya matambiko bhakolo na bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo na akahokolo bhakamanyite nnandanikiho ghongo gwalongi bhene. Peniya bhapata kujhigha kunkamuu, bhalijhogwipa lilongo lya bhando. Bhahe, bhajhakunneka, na bhene kujhenda.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupiya kode kwa munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Loma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matei 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Bhahe, Mapwalichayo na bhabholwa bha kikunde cha Helode bhakatumitwe bhanyambii Yecho kwa malobhe ghake. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Bhajhakunyendelela na kunnobholela, “Mmola, timanya mwenga mundo jwamaha jhumulonge chakaka, hilu minyoghopajhe mundo jhojhoha. Hilu ukolo gwa mundo kwino mwenga kilebhe nacho, mibhola chakaka ndela jha Chapanga. Tunkonye bho, ndi maha kulepa kode kwa munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Loma?, Tilepe amu tikoto kulepa?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Nambo Yecho akamanye umbebhebhe gwabhe, ajhakwalobholela, “Bho, munyighanikiya nhwalo gwa nike? Unangiye mbijha.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Bhajhakunnetela. Na jwenio ajhakwakonya, “Kumiho kongo kwa ghane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Bhajhakunyanguu, “Kwa munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Loma.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Bhahe, Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Yu munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Loma mupela munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Loma, na ya Chapanga mupela jwenio Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Bhajhakukangachwa nako jwenio.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilobhe lya kuyoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matei 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Peniya Machadukayo bhubhalongi kuyoka kubhii jhe bhajhakunyendelela Yecho, bhajhakunkonya, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>“Mmola, Mucha akatulaghalikii, ‘Mundo anda awile na kuleka mwikeghe ntonga, nnongo mundo antole amujhi lipwela, ampapile nnongo mundo yana.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Bhahe, tulongele, pakibha na akalongo chaba. Jwakutumbula ajhakutolela mwikeghe, akawile changa mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Jhubhena ajhakumujhii lipwela, na jwenio akawile changa mwana, na jwa utato akawile changa leka mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Bhoha chaba bhakawii changa leka yana. Na kujhomolela lipwela ajhakuwegha. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Bhahe, lichiko lya bhando pibhapala kuyoka mwikeghe jwenio nabhaha nhwana gwa ghane? Bhoha chaba bhakantolile.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Mangota mwe nnemwite nhwalo mughamanyitejhe Majhandiko gha Chapanga hilu likakala lya Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Bhando bhibhawile anda bhayokite bhatole ndeka amu kutolelwa, nabhabhaha ngita akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Kuyoka kwa bhubhawile, bho, nchomitejhe mukitabo cha Mucha chehemo jha kiheghejha chikitinika mwotu? Chapanga ajhakunnobholela Mucha, ‘Nenga na Chapanga jwa Ulahimo, Chapanga jwa Isaka na Chapanga jwa Yakobu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Bhahe, jwenio chi Chapanga jwa bhando bhubhawile. Nambo Chapanga jwa bhando bhibhabhii na ughome. Mangota mwe nnemwite hake.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaghalikilo likolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matei 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Jhumo jwa bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo ajhakuhika, akajhohine mitaungano jhabhe, pamonita Yecho ajhangwii mbone, ajhakukilaa, na kunkonya, “Bho, Malaghalikilo ghoha ghahalile, lyoke lya kutumbula?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yecho ajhakunnyanguu, “Lya kutumbuu lende, ‘Nnyokanikiya bhando bha ku Ichilahele! Bhambo Chapanga gwito, kanjika chake Bhambo. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Mupale Bhambo Chapanga gwino kwa mwojho gwino ghoha, kwa ughome gwino ghoha, kwa malango ghino ghoha na kwa likakala lino lyoha.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Na jha ubhele jhenje, ‘Mupale nnyino ngita chimukipala mabhene.’ Libhiijhe lenge lilaghalikilo kupeta lyenio.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Bhahe, mmola jwa malaghalikiho jhola ajhakunobholela, “Ghamaha mmola! Nnongii chakaka Chapanga jhumo abhii jhe jhonge ngita jwenio. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Mundo ampale Chapanga kwa mwojho gwake ghoha, kwa malango ghoha, na kwa likakala lyoha na kumpala nnyino ngita chimkipala mabhene. Lijhambu lyamaha kupeta litambiko lya kukomelekeya na kiyombo chenge.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yecho panolokiya mundo jwenio ajhangwii kwa kukikakamula, ajhakunobholela, “Mwenga mmi jhe kutale kunnekekeya Chapanga anongoche ughome gwino munahota nkolongwa.” Pajhomolila gheniya, Na bhene bhakajhighite jhe kunkonya machwale ghange.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lijhambu lya Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matei 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Yecho pakibha abholita bhando pa Nyumba jha Chapanga, ajhakukonya, Bho, bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo bhilonge Kilichitu ndi mwana gwa Daude? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Daude jwenio alongwichwa na Uhuke gwa Chapanga alongila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Bhambo akanobholile Bhambo gwango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Ndame lubhoko lwalelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">ade nibhabheke akamakoko kuhe jha magholo ghino.<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>“Daude jwenio inkema Kilichitu nkomboche Bhambo. Bhahe, Kilichitu nabhe bho, mwana mundo?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yecho abhalongele bhando bhakichunge na bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matei 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Lilongo lya bhando ukibha unyokanikiya kwa kuhangana. <verse eid="MRK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Mu mabholo ghake, Yecho akalongii, “Mukichunge na bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo upala kupetapeta kongo bhakiwalile makanjo matandamaho na kujhambuchwa kwa ichima mulighuliho. <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Helahela bhene upala kuhaghuu kutama mukigoda ya palonge pa nyumba jha kukonganikii Akayahude, na kutola pwache jha ichima muunyagho gwa kulyegha. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Na kwajhibhila akakeghe akanawela kongo bhakilangiya kwa bhando kunnyopa Chapanga kwa malobhe gha mahena! Lichiko lya mwicho nabhabha mulung'ahe lukolongwa bhando bhene!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Litambiko lya mwikeghe nawela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Yecho pakibha abhandikii mukichukilo kichokombe cha kupekiya mbijha. Alolita bhando chibhalekela mbijha mukichukilo chikibhii nkate munyumba jha kunyope Chapanga. Bhando bhapihita yamahele ibhabhii nayo. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Peniya ajhakuhika majhe jhumo nhocho nawela, ajhakupiya chente ibhena ya mbijha. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Peniya Yecho ajhakwakema bhabholwa bhake, ajhakwalobholela, “Ninnobholela chakaka, majhe jhonjo jwanga kilebhe nawela alekii kilebhe kikolongwa mukichukilo cha kulekele mbijha kuliku bhange. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Bhando bhange bhoha bhapihite ilebhe kubhoka mu majhonjekeko ghabhe. Nambo majhe honjo nhocho, akung'winde ilebhe yake yoha yabhii nako, akwangalikii kila kilebhe chikintangatila abhehe ghome.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yecho ajhakulonge kubomola kwa nyumba jha Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matei 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Yecho pakibha apitita mu Nyumba jha Chapanga, jhumo jwa bhabholwa bhake ajhakunnobholela, “Mmola, dolekeya maghanga na majhumba ghanga chighabhii ghambone gha kukangacha!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Bho, mughahwene majhumba ghanga chighabhii makolongwa? Libhii jhe hilu lighanga limo lilipala kuhighalika panane jha lighanga lenge, kila kilebhe nakibhaha heghuheghu.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagho na lung'ahe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matei 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Yecho pakibha atamite panane pa kitombe chuku Micheitune alolekiya Nyumba jha Chapanga, Petile na Yakobu na Yohane na Anduleya bhajhakunkonya pakiyepela, <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>“Chonde, mutulobholele ilebhe henge naihengeka ligha? Bho, na nginyililo ghane jhipala kulangiya kuhika kwino na upehekelo gwa machiko?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Yecho ajhakutumbuu kwalobholela, “Mukilolekehe mundo akoto kuhika na kunkopokeya. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Bhamahena nabhahika kwa liina lyango, jhumo nalongela, jwenio ndi nenga! Na bhene nabhankopokeya bhando bhamahele. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Pumipala kujhoha mbwepo ya ngondo na bhando bhalonge malobhe gha ngondo, nkotoka kujhoghopa. Ilebhe yenio naipitila tugha, Nambo kujhomokela kwake kwamela. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Kilambo chimo na akakomana na kilambo chenge, unahota nkolongwa ghumo naukomana na unahota ghonge, kila chehemo napabha nnindimilo gwa nnema nailongohana na njala. Ilebhe henge ngita lipyanda lya kutumbuu kupapa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>“Mangota mwe mukilangiye mana bhando nabhatenda kuntakalila pa bwalo, na kunchwapula yato mu Nyumba jha kukonganikii Akayahude. Nabhampeleka palonge jha akanahota malongelele, ndi kwa nhwalo gwa nenga. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Nambo Malobhe gha Mbone naghatangachwa kwa ilambo yoha. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Na bhene pibhapala kunkamu na kuntakalila, nkoto kubhehe na kindondwa chimpala kulonge. Muda pupala kuhika nnongele chochoha chimpala kupelwa, mangota mwe ndeka jhumpala kulonge, nambo Uhuke gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Nnongo nanyambila nnongo mundo akomwe na tate nanyambila mwana mundo, na yana yenio hele nabhakachulana akatate bhabhe na kwakoma. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Bhando bhoha nabhanchimwa mangota nhwalo gwa liina lyango, nambo jwapala kuhimbilila ade kujhomolela jwenio naghombokoka mulung'ahe lwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ling'ahe likolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matei 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>“Pumpala kubhona lijhambu lihakanaho lilihangabhana lijhemite pangapala kujhema.” Jwachoma na amanye. Peniya bhubhabhii pa Yudeya bhabhutikila ku kitombe. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Nambo mundo jhojhoha jwabhii pa kipaghalo akotoka kuhuluka kujhingii nkate na kutola ilebhe yake! <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Helahela jwabhii kunghonda akotoka kubhujha kajhake na kutola magwanda ghake. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Nakole kiya hake kwa akakeghe bhubhabhii na ndumbo na bhibhajhongecha nabhabhaha mumalagho kwa machiko gheniya! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Mbaha tunyope ilebhe yenio ikoto kupitii machiko gha malile. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Nhwalo machiko gheniya napabhaha na lung'ahe kuhumii Chapanga mukupanganwa nnema lunawahijhe kupitila na hilu naipitijhe kabhele. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Peniya Bhambo nakupongocha jhe machiko gheniya abhii jhe mundo jwapala kughombokoka. Peniya nhwalo gwa bhando bhake, apongwiche machiko gheniya.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>“Bhahe, mundo anda anongalile, ‘Dolekeya, Kilichitu abhii pamba,’ amu ‘Abhii kola,’ nkotoka kunyokanikiya. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Nhwalo nabhapitila bhakilichitu bhuwange na milondole bhauwange. Nabhalangiya nginyililo ngolonga na ikangacho ya kuhotu kwakopokeya bhando bhake Chapanga anda nabhahotola. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Mangota mwe mukilolekeye. Nenga ninnobholile ghoha kabula jha kupitila.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwake kwa mwana gwa mundo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matei 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>“Machiko gheniya, pulupala kupeta lung'ahe lono, lyobha nalibhaha nkate mulubhendo na mwehe naupihajhe lilangamule. <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>Na ndondwa naigwaha kuhumii kunane kwa Chapanga, na ilebhe yoha na likakala lya kunane kwa Chapanga nainyukanyuka. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Peniya naumona nenga, Mwana gwa Mundo, nikahika na mahunde na kwa makakala twe gha ukolo. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Peniya nabhatuma akatumiche bhake bhajhende mu pande yoha ncheche ya nnema bhakabhatole bhando bhake bhubhahaghulilwe na Chapanga kuhumii mujhomokelo ghongo ade upeekeho gwa nnema.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Libholo lya nkongo nkojho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matei 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>“Mukibhole nnandanikiho ghongo kuhumii nkongo gwa nkojho, mandabhe gha nkongo ghabhii mabhehe utumbuu kupiya mahamba, umanye kubhehe machiko gha kuhuna ghabhandikile. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Helahela kwa mangota pimpala kughabhona ghahengeka gheniya ghoha, umanya Mwana gwa Mundo abhandikii kuhika. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Ninnobholela chakaka, kibheluko chenje nakipete jhe kabula jha kuhengeka ghanga. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Kunane kwa Chapanga na ilambo yoha nahipeta, nambo Malobhe ghango naghapitila ngita chinilonge.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abhii jhe jwamanya lichiko lyenio</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matei 24:36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>“Nambo abhii jhe mundo jwamanya lichiko amu lichaa lyenio nalihika ligha, hilu akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga. Hilu Mwana, nga Tate ndi jwamanya. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Mukilolekehe na kukilenganikiya nhwalo mulimanyitejhe lichiko hilu lichaa lya kuhika. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Naibhaha anda mundo jwabhokite pakajha jhake kutumbu mwanja na kwalekela ukindendeke akatumiche bhubhahighalike kajha, kila jhumo na lihengo lyake na kunobholela nnonda jwa pakajha akotoka kugholoka. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Chonde nkeluwe bhahe, mukilenganikiye, nhwalo umanyitejhe nkolo nyumba nabhujha ligha. Pange kimihe amu uhiko amu putiputi amu lukela. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Chonde mukilolekeye na mukakilenganikiye, anda ahikite kwa kupwitikalila, kongo ankoli ngholwike. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Malobhe ghuninnobholela mangota, chonde ninnobholela mabhoha. Mukilolekehe na mukilenganikiye!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Bhando bhipanga kunkoma Yecho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matei 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohane 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Ghakahighalike machiko mabhele kuhika unyagho gwa Pachaka gwa Kiyahude na unyagho gwa Mabumunda ghangangedule. Akapiya matambiko bhakolo na bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo bhakolo bhapaliya ndela jha kukamuu kwa kupwepa jha kunkoma Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Peniya bhajhakulonge, “Tukoto kuhenga yenio lichiko lya unyagho gwa Pachaka, bhando bhiwecha kubheka bhulo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho bhimpaka mahuta gha kunungila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matei 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohane 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yecho pakibha ku Betaniya, kajha kwa Simone kangombo jwakanamiche ulwalo gwa malohe. Yecho patehila kulyegha, majhe jhumo jwakibha na chupa jhikatenganichwe kwa maghanga ghikemwa Alabasita jhikibha na mahuta gha kunungila petelele ghikemwa naludo bei jhake ngolonga. Ajhakudindu chupa jhene, ajhakunyitila mahuta gheniya Yecho pamuto. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Bhando bhange bhibhakibha peniya pibhalolita lyenio bhajhakuyoma, bhajhakupwepa, “Nhwalo gwa nike kuhobheha mahuta petelele ngita ghanga? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Mahuta gheniya ghiwecha kuchuluchwa kwa mbijha jha nchahala gwa mundo jwahenga lihengo kwa chaka chimo, kwabhaghanichila akahocho na bhala bhanga kilebhe!” Majhe jwenio bhajhakumpwatalila.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Nambo Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Muneke! Nhwalo gwa nike kung'aa? Chatei chambone. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Bhando bhina nhocho bhabhii pamonga na mangota machiko ghoha, mihoto kwatangatila pimipala. Nenga namejhe pamonga mangota mwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Majhe hojho ateile pahotwile. Ajhitii yegha jhango mahuta kubheka mbone yegha jhango kabula jha malelo ghango. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Ninnobholela chakaka, popoha pannema Lilobhe lya Mbone nalitangachwa, bhando chibhalobholela bhando bhange kilebhe chenie chakiteii majhe jhola nakilongelwa na kukombokwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ajhekete kunyambii Yecho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matei 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Peniya Yuda Ichikaliyote, jhumo jwa bhabholwa kome na bhabhele, ajhakujhenda kwa akapiya matambiko bhakolo kunnyambii Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Akapiya matambiko bhakolo bhakahangine pibhajhohina malobhe gheniya, bhajhakulaghana kumpeke mbijha. Peniya Yuda ajhakutumbuu kupalaha ndela jha kunnyambila Yecho.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ilyegha unyagho gwa Pachaka na bhabholwa bhake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matei 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohane 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Lichiko lya kutumbula kwa unyagho gwa Mabumunda ghangalekela ngedule, Mwana limbelele lya ilulo ya Pachaka uchinjwa, bhabholwa bhake bhajhakunkonya, “Mipala tujhende kojhe tukalenganikiye chehemo jha kulelela Pachaka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Bhahe, Yecho ajhakwatuma bhabhele pakate jha bhabholwa bhake ajhakwalobholela, “Nnyende kubomane, namunkolela likambako atwekii kihulo cha mache. Munkengame, <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>munobholele Nkolo nyumba munnobholela, ‘Mmola ankonya, chumbi cha akaghene kibhii kojhe, chakulyegha Pachaka pamonga na bhabholwa bhango?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Jwenio nanangiya chumbi kikolongwa cha ku gholofa, chikikilimwe mbone, mutulenganikila mwenio.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Na bhabholwa bhajhakujhenda kubomane, na kukikolela kila kilebhe kipanginwe ngita chabhalaghalikiye Yecho. Bhajhakulenganikiya chakulye Pachaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Pukihikita kimihe, Yecho ajhakujhenda pamonga peniya na bhabholwa bhake kome na bhabhele. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Pubhakibha bhatamite pamonga mukulyegha, Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Ninobholela chakaka, abhii jhumo jhutulye nako, nandenda kunyambila.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Peniya bhabholwa bhake bhajhakubhehe ngolongondi, jhumo jhumo bhajhakutumbuu kunkonya, “Bho, ndi nenga?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Ndi jhumo kuhumii pamangota mwe kome na bhabhele, jwachwika libumunda pamonga na nenga mu bakule. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Chakaka, Mwana gwa Mundo nahwa ngita Majhandiko gha Chapanga chighalonge. Chapata malagho mundo jhola nanyambila Mwana gwa Mundo! Mbaha kwa mundo jwenio ngabhelwikejhe!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulyegha pamonga na Bhambo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matei 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Akakolintu 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Pubhatehila kulyegha, Yecho ajhakutola libumunda ajhakunchenguu kunomba Chapanga, ajhakumetula na kwabhaghanichila bhabholwa bhake alongila, “Ntolangane, jhenje lilandanikilo lya yegha jhango.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Peniya ajhakutola kibaba cha divaye, ajhakunnomba Chapanga ajhakwapekiya bhoha bhajhakunywegha divaye mukibaba chenjeno chenio. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Ajhakwalobholela, “Jhenje miyahe jhango jhibheka lilaghano lya Chapanga, miyahe jhijhitika kwa nhwalo gwa kulekekeya uhakaho gwa bhando twe. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Ninnobholela chakaka, nanywe jhe kabhele divaye jha chabibo ade lichiko lela pimpala kunywegha mu unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Peniya bhajhakujhemba nhwambo gwa kunnomba Chapanga, bhajhakubhoka, na kujhenda ku Kitombe chuku Micheitune.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ilote Petile natenda kunkana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matei 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohane 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela bhabholwa bhake, “Mangota mwe natila na kunneka nenga, kuhumii mu Majhandiko gha Chapanga, Chapanga alonge, ‘Naninkoma nnuchajhe, na gheniya mambelele naghapechengana.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Nambo pumbala kuyoka, naninongolela kujhenda ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Petile ajhakunobholela, “Hata bhange bhabhehe na iholo na kunneka, nenga natubhaha pamonga, naninekajhe!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yecho ajhakunobholela, “Ninobholela chakaka ma Petile, uhiko ghongone ghone, lijhogholo nakubhekajhe naunganila patato umanyitejhe nenga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Nambo Petile ajhakughagha kulonge, “Hata kuwegha nyeketile kuwegha pamonga na mwenga, nanineka ng'o.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Bhabholwa bhoha bhajhakulonge helahela ngita chakalongile Petile.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho anyopa Chapanga ku buchitane jha Getichemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:35-46">Matei 26:35-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Bhajhakuhika kunghonda gwandina ghunkemwa Getechemane, Yecho ajhakwalobholela bhabholwa bhake, “Ntamangane pamba nenga nijhenda kunnyopa Chapanga palapa.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Ajhakulongohana na Petile na Yakobu na Yohane. Na jwenio Yecho ajhakubhehe ngolongonde na malagho. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Mwojho gwango ubhii ngolongonde ngita nipala kuwegha. Ntamengane pambano nkeluwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Yecho ajhakujhenda palonge, na ajhakukigwiya pahe mangukama, ajhakunnyopa Chapanga alongila, anda ipala lilagho limambale. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Ajhakulonge, “Tate gwango, gheniya ghoha ghiwechekana kwino mwenga. Nambo umokehe kibaba cha malagho ghanga. Nambo ngita chimipala mwenga, chi chinipala nenga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Pabhujhita kwa bhabholwa bhake bhala bhatato ajhakwakolela bhagholwike. Bhahe, ajhakunnyimuha Petile na kunkonya, “Ma Simone, ngholwike? Uhotwijhe kukeluha nobe lichaa limo?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Nkotoka kugholoka na munyopengane Chapanga nkotoka kujhingii mumajhighanikilo. Uhuke ndi upala, nambo yegha itotokalile.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Ajhakujhenda kunyopa Chapanga kabhele abhujhila malobhe ghaghala ghala. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Ajhakubhujha, ajhakwakolela bhamela bhagholwike. Miho ghabhe ghamela ghina lugwenio. Bhakamanyitejhe lakujhanguu.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Pabhajhimuwa mala jhutato ajhakwalobholela “Ngholwike kabhele? Ngohe ikwela kujhimuka! Lichaa lyenio libhandikile! Mwana gwa Mundo nabhankamuwa kwa bhando bhubhabhii na uhakaho. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Nnyimukane, tijhangana. Dolekeya, mundo jhola jwapala kunyambila nenga abhandikile.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho bhinkamula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matei 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohane 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Yecho pajhendelela kulonge, mmolwa jwake jhumo liina lyake Yuda ajhakupiti pamo na lilongo lya bhando ghugheghite mapanga na indukwa. Bhibhatumitwe na akapiya matambiko bhakolo na bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo pamonga na ighogholo. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Bhahe, Yuda jhola jwakanyambi Yecho, ajhakwalangiya nginyililo bhando bhala, “Mundo jhunimpala kunkumbatila, ndi umanya jhojho. Mukamula na kumeka pahe jha akakomana ngondo bhino.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Pabhokita peniya Yuda, ajhakunyenda chomola kwa Yecho na kunobholela, “Mmola!” Peniya ajhakunkumbatila. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Lilongo lela lijhakunkamuu Yecho na kumeka pahe jha ulonda gwabhe. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Jhumo jwa bhabholwa bhake jwakabhandike pakibha Yecho, ajhakuholomola upanga muchako, na kuheketa lichikilo lya ntumiche jhumo jwa Mpiya litambiko nkolo. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yecho ajhakwalobholela, “Bho, nhwalo gwa nike uhikita kungamuu kwa mapanga na indukwa ngita nenga jwandwekwile lilaghalikilo? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Machiko ghoha nikibha pamonga na mangota molita mu Nyumba jha Chapanga, hilu mukangamwiijhe. Ngoheno Majhandiko gha Chapanga ghalenganile.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Peniya bhabholwa bhake bhoha bhajhakunneka na kutila.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Ajhakupeta kangombo jhumo, jwawalite nkwinda tugha jwampaliya Yecho. Na jwenio bhajhakunkamula. <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>Na jwenio ajhakwalema, Ajhakuulekekeya nkwinda gwake, na kutila matako matopo.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho bhantakali pa Bwalo jha akanahota</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matei 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohane 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Bhajhakumpeleka Yecho kajha kwa Mpiya litambiko nkolo, bhakibha na bhene akapiya matambiko bhakolo na ighogholo na bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo bhakakonganike pamo. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Petile ajhakunkengamila Yecho kwa chukutale ade ajhakujhingii mulwane lwa Mpiya litambiko nkolo. Ajhakutama pamonga na akakomana ngondo, bhajhotita mwotu. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Akapiya Matambiko bhakolo bha pa bwalo bhajhakupalaha matakalilo ghuwange panane jha Yecho bhankome, na bhene bhakapatitejhe. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Bhando bhamahele bhajhakulonge malobhe ghuwange, nambo malobhe ghabhe ghakalandine ndeka.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Na bhange bhajhakujhema, kulonge helahela malobhe ghuwange, bhalongila. <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Twenga tukajhohine chalongila, ‘Nenga nihoto kuitilulana Nyumba jha Chapanga jhichengwite na bhando na machiko matato na njenga jhenge jhangachengwa na bhando.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Pamonga na gheniya malobhe ghabhe ghajhakukanwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Mpiya litambiko nkolo ajhakujhema palonge pa bwalo na kunkonya Yecho, “Bho, mwenga mihoto ndeka kujhanguu matakalilo ghubhantakalile bhando palonge jhino?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Yecho akajhangwii ndeka kilebhe, akibha nuu. Mpiya litambiko nkolo ajhakunkonya kabhele, “Mwenga ndi mwa Kilichitu, Mwana gwa Chapanga jhunombitwe?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yecho ajhakujhanguu, “Nenga ndi. Kabhele namummona Mwana gwa mundo atamite lubhoko lwalelo lwa Bhambo jwabhii na likakala. Nahika kuhumii kumahunde gha kunane kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>peniya Mpiya litambiko nkolo ajhakujwepula ligwanda lyake, ajhakulonge, “Tupala ndeka mundo jhojhoha alongele malobhe gha kuntakalila mundo jhonjo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>“Mangota mwenga nnyohine kuligha! Mangota bho, mihola nike?” Bhoha bhajhakulonge Yecho akomwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Bhahe, bhando bhange bhajhakunhunii mata, na bhange bhajhakunhibha miho, bhajhakuntyala mbalamande na kunnobholela, “Nnotele, ghane jwantyalite!” Na bhando bhange akatumiche mwenio bhajhakuntyala mbalamande.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petile ankana Yecho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matei 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohane 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Petile pakibha kuyeto ku lwane, ntumiche jhumo mwikeghe ajhakuhika kwa Mpiya litambiko nkolo. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Pamonita Petile ajhota mwotu, ajhakuningukiya hake, ajhakunnobholela, “Mwenga ntyangita pamonga na Yecho jwa ku Nachalete.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Nambo Petile ajhaukana, “Alongela manyitejhe chimulongela!” Peniya Petile ajhakubhoka na kujhenda kuyeto ku lubhegho. Lijhogholo lijhakubheka.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Jhola ntumiche mwikeghe pamonita kabhele Petile, ajhakutumbula kwalobholela bhando bhubhakibha bhajhemite peniya, “Mundo jhonjo bhakibha pamo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Petile ajhakukana katakata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Bhando bhubhakabhandikile pajhemite Petile, bhajhakunobholela, “Chakaka mwenga ndi mundo jhumo jwakibha nabho, ata mwenga ndi mundo jwa ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Petile ajhakutumbuu, alongila umbele likoto anda nilonge uwange, “Nenga niumanyite jhe mundo jhonjo jhumulongela malobhe ghake.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Papalapala lijhogholo lijhakubheka kabhele, peniya Petile ajhakukomboka malobhe ghalongila Yecho, “Lijhogholo nakubhekajhe mala jha ubhele, naundenda kungana mala patato.” Petile ajhakugwiya pahe na kulela.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yecho bhampeleka kwa Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matei 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohane 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Putiputi lukela, Akapiya matambiko bhakolo pamonga na anakahota, bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo na kibhogha cha pa bwalo ghoha bhajhakukonganika. Yecho bhajhakuntabha nganganga na kunchindikicha kwa Pilatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Pilatu ajhakunkonya Yecho, “Bho, mwenga ndi munahota nkolongwa jwa Akayahude?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yecho ajhakujhanguu, “Chakaka, mwenga ndi milongela.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Akapiya matambiko bhajhakuntakalila Yecho kwa ilebhe twe. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Pilatu ajhakunkonya kabhele, “Bho, kibhii ndeka cha kulonge? Nnyohine matakalilo ghubhantakalile panane jhino.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Nambo Yecho akajhangwii jhe, peniya Pilatu ajhakuhechuka.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilatu ampiya Yecho bhantende kindalaha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matei 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yohane 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">Yohane 19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Kila Unyagho gwa Pachaka, bhando bhakajhobhalile Pilatu kwadindulila mpungwa jhumo jhubhakampahile jwakatabhitwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Muda gwenio, akibha mundo jhumo liina lyake Balaba, na jwenie akatabhitwe mukipungo pamonga na bhando bhange bhubhatehile majhoghe ghanganandela na kukoma bhando. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Na lilongo lya bhando lijhakunyendelela Pilatu na kunnobholela ngita chayobhalile bhannekekehe mundo jhumo. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pilatu ajhakwakonya, “Bho, mipala ninyogholele jhonjo munahota nkolongwa jwa Akayahude?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Jwenio akamanye akapiya matambiko bhakolo bhantakalila Yecho nhwalo gwa wiho gwabhe.<verse eid="MRK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Akapiya matambiko bhakolo bhajhakuchocha kukokelekeya lilongo lya bhando bhalongele bhannyogholele Balaba bhaneke Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>14 Pilatu ajhakwakonya kabhele, “Bho, mipala ndende nike na mundo jhonjo jhubhankema munahota nkolongwa jwa Akayahude?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Bhando bhajhakuchobholela bhalongila, “Mumambe panchalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pilatu ajhakwakonya, “Nike chikichochite! Alemwite kilebhe ghane?” Bhene bhajhakuchocha kuchobhela kanonoha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Bhalongila “Abhambwe panchalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Pilatu ajhakujhigha kukongelekeya lilongo lya bhando, lijhakwadindulila Balaba. Na Yecho bhantyale yato lwa limbendela lya ndomondo, na kummoha abhambwe panchalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akomana ngondo bhameke chanake Yecho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:27">Matei 27:27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohane 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Peniya akakomana ngondo bhajhakumpeleka Yecho ade nkate jha liboma, gwa nyumba jha Pilatu, jwakibha nkolo jwa kilambo cha ku Yudeya, ujhakukonganika likunde lyoha lya akakomana ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Bhajhakupuka Yecho nngholole gwa lange jha jivihi ngita munahota nkolongwa, bhajhakuhinga hingo jha mibha, na kubheka pamuto gwake. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Bhajhakutumbuu kunyambucha kwa kunnongama, “Mbukwa munahota nkolongwa jwa Akayahude!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Bhakantyalite kwa yato ya milahe kumuto kubhujhii na kubhujhila na bhajhakunhunii mata. Bhajhakutama makilikite na kunyinamila jwenio. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Pubhajhomolila kuntende chanake, bhakanhulite ngobho hela jhibhakahwaliche, na kuhwalicha ngobho yake, bhahe, bhajhakumpeleka bhakamambe panchalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ibhambwa panchalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matei 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohane 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Mundo jhumo kuhumii ku kilambo cha ku Kilene, liina lyake Simone, tate gwabhe Alekichanda na Lufo. Ateila kupeta kujhingii kubomane ahumita kuchenda, akakomana ngondo bhajhakughaghalila Simone agheghe nchalaba gwakibha nagho Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Peniya bhajhakumpeleka Yecho ade pa Goligota, mana jhake chehemo jhibhonekana ngita libhonge lya muto. <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Na bhene peniya bhajhakumpekeya divaye jhihangalwine na ntela ghukemwa manemane, Yecho akanywii ndeka. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Bhahe, bhajhakummamba pa chalaba, na ngobho yake bhajhakubhaghana kwa kahumbuumbu nnobhole na bhamanye ghane natola ligwanda. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Pihikita cha tato lukela kujhakutumbukana kubhambwa kwa Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Na panane jha nchalaba bhakajhandike litakalilo lende, “MUNAHOTA NKOLONGWA JWA AKAYAHUDE.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Papalapala bhajhakubhambwa bhando bhabhele pa michalaba, bhibhapokita ilebhe kwa likakala, jhumo lubhoko lwalelo lwa Yecho na jhonge lubhoko lwa ngejha. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Na ghanga ghakamilike Majhandiko gha Chapanga ghighalongila, “Nahangalwanwa pamonga na bhibhatenda ghanganandela.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Bhando bhubhapetita peniya bhajhakunnigha maligho kongo bhakinicha muto jhabhe, bhalongila “Oko! Mwenga nganongila nantilulana Nyumba jha Chapanga na kuchenga kwa machiko matato! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Bhahe, mukikombole mabhene! Na uhuluke pa nchalaba.”<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Na bhene Akapiya Matambiko bhakolo pamonga na bhabhola bha Malaghalikilo bhajhakunongama bhalongila, “Jwenio abhakombwila bhajhake, jwenio abhii chepa kukikombola! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Hote jhojho Kilichitu, munahota nkolongwa jwa Akaichilahele! ngoheno ahuluke kuhumii pa nchalaba tubhehe na kihobholelo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Na bhala bhibhakibha mukubhambwa pabhandikii Yecho na bhene bhajhakunnigha.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhwe kwa Yecho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-46">Matei 27:45-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Pihikila muhe jha chaa chita ade chaa ticha lubhendo lujhakubhehe tyoo kilambo choha. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Cha ticha pilibhandikila lyobha kutipika Yecho ajhakulela kanonoha, alongila “Eloi, Eloi, lama chabakitane?” Mana jhake, “Chapanga gwango, Chapanga gwango, mbone uneka kanjika?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Bhando bhibhakajhemite pabhandikii Yecho pibhajhohina malobhe gheniya, bhajhakulonge, “Munyokanikiye! Inkema Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Mundo jhumo ajhakubhutuka lubhelo kutola lidodoke na kulichwiya mu divaye jhibhabhite, na kubheka mu nahe, na kutondobhekeya ajhakumeke pannomo alongila, “Bhahe, munneke, tulole jwenio Eliya nahika kunhuluha kuhumii pachalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Peniya Yecho ajhakubohoma kanonoha, na kuwegha.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Papala lipanjiya lya Nyumba jha Chapanga lijhakujwepuka ipande ibhele kutumbulii kunane ade pahe. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Nkolo jwa akakomana ngondo, jwakatamite palonge jha nchalaba gwa Yecho, pajhohina lilobhe lya kukuluma na kuwegha kwake, ajhakulonge, “Chakaka mundo jhonjo akibha Mwana gwa Chapanga!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Bhakibha akakeghe bhibhakibha bhalingulila chukutale, pakate jhabhe akibha Maliya mundo jwa kuhumii ku Magidala na Chalome na Maliya majhe gwabhe Yakobu unung'una mundo Yoche. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Akakeghe bhamba bhakalongohine na Yecho pakibha ku Galilaya kwa nhwalo gwa kuntangatila. Na akakeghe bhange twe bhakahikite pamonga na jwenio ku Yeluchalemo.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yegha jha Yecho ibhekwa mumambe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matei 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohane 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Pukihita kimiho, likibha lichiko lya kukibheka mbone kabula jha Lichiko lya Kupomolela. <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Peniya Uchupo jwa kilambo cha ku Alimataya, mundo munahota jwa pa bwalo jwakibha bhanendema hake. Na jwenio alendila kuhika kwa Unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga. Bhahe, Uchupo ajhakunyendelela Pilatu changajhoghopa, na kunnyopa ampele yegha jha Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Kongo Pilatu atehila kukangacha pajhohina Yecho ajhomwike. Ajhakunkema nkomana ngondo na kunkonya ngita Yecho ajhomwike mandahe. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Pilatu papatita malobhe kuhumii kwa nkomana ngondo jhola chakaka Yecho ajhomwike, ajhakumpekeya Uchupo yegha jha Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Peniya Uchupo ajhakuhemela chanda na kubhilingilila malelo gha Yecho, na kujhenda kuhuluha yegha kuhumii panane jha nchalaba na kuibheka pahe, ajhakubhingilila ngobho jha malelo. Ajhakughoneka umambe lilikibha lihokonywilwe pa lindalabho, ajhakubhilimbiya kiyekelelo cha lighanga pa nnyango gwa mambe na kuhibha. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Na Maliya jwa ku kilambo chuku Magidala na Maliya majhe mundo Yoche bhakapawene peniya pibhaghonike yegha jha Yecho.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyhoka kwa Yecho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matei 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohane 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Lichiko lya Kupomolela pilijhomokila, Maliya mundo jwa ku kilambo chaku Magidala na Maliya majhe mundo Yakobu na Chalome bhajhakuhemela mahuta ghughanungila petelele na kujhenda kupaka yegha ya Yecho. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Lukala, jumapile, pulipitita lyobha, bhajhakujhenda ku mambe. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Undela bhatehila kukonyana bhene kwa bhene, “Ndi ghane jwabhilimbiye lighanga kubhoka pa nnyango jha mambe?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Pibhalolikiya, bhajhakulibhona lighanga lela likolongwa libhilimbiwe kubhoka panyango gwa mambe. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Pibhajhingila nkate mu mambe, bhajhakumona kangombo jhumo jwawalite ngobho nhuo ya mbuu, atamite lubhoko lwalelo, na bhene bhajhakuhechuka hake.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Kangombo jhola ajhakwalobholela, “Nkotoka kuhechuka. Mipalaha Yecho jwa ku Nachalete jwakabhambitwe panane. Ayokite! Abhii jhe pambano. Nnolekehe pakagholwike. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Nnyende makalobholele bhabholwa bhake pamonga na Petile, alongolile kujhenda ku Galilaya, kwenio ndi nabhamona, ngita chabhalobholila.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Peniya, bhajhakupita umambe jha Yecho na kubhutuka mbelo, kongo bwaghaliya na kikangacho chakamwile. Na bhene bhakalongii ndeka kwa mundo jhojhoha lilobhe lela nhwalo bhajhogwipa hake.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho ampitii Maliya jwa ku kilambo cha ku Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matei 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohane 20:11-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Yecho pahyokita putiputi lichiko lya jumapile, mundo jwatumbwila kumpitila akibha Maliya jwa kilambo cha Magidala, jhola jwakampihite michuka chaba. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Maliya jwa ku kilambo chaku Magidala ajhakujhenda, kwalobholela bhabholwa bhake bhubhakibha bhubhalongohina pamonga na Yecho, na bhene bhakibha bhalelita malelo. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Pubhajhohina Yecho abhi nghome na Maliya jwa Magidala akongine nako, bhene bhakajheketile ndeka.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho abhapitii bhabholwa bhake bhabhele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Yecho ajhakwapetela pakate ja bhabholwa bhake bhabhele bhubhakibha bhajhahwila kuchenda. Na bhene bhakamanyitejhe. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Na bhene bhajhakubhujha, kwalobholela bhabholwa bhajhabhe. Na bhene helahela bhakajheketii ndeka.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho abhapitii bhabholwa bhake kome na jhumo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matei 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohane 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mahengo 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Pajhomolila, Yecho ajhakwapitii bhabholwa bhake kome na jhumo bhibhakibha bhatehila kulyegha. Ajhakwapwatalila nhwalo ghane gwangajheketela kwabhe na kujhundupa kwabhe, bhajhabhe bhibhakonginika nako kuhumii mu kuyoka. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Ajhakwalobholela, “Nnyendengane mu ilambo yoha, mukalitangache Lilobhe lya Chapanga kwa bhando bhoha. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Mundo jhojhoha jwapala kujheketela na kubatichwa, Chapanga nakombola. Na mundo jhojhoha jwangajheketela kubatichwa natenda kulagha. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Na ikangacho henge nahilongohana na bhoha bhibhanyeketile. Kwa liina lyango nabhabhoha michuka, nabhalongela kwa lugha nhyono. <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>Na bhakamula lijhoka kwa mabhoko na kunywegha kilebhe chochoha chikibhii na uchongo, na chabhahwe ndeka. Nabhabheka mabhoko panane jha muto kwa bhibhalwalwa, na Chapanga nabhalamicha.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yecho atolwa kujhenda kunane kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mahengo 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Peniya Bhambo Yecho pajhomolila kulonge nabho, ajhakutolwa kujhenda kunane kwa Chapanga. Na kutama pamonga na Chapanga mihotolo gwake. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Peniya bhabholwa bhajhakujhenda kila kimbokotole kutangacha Lilobhe lya Mbone. Bhambo ajhakuhenga lihengo pamonga na bhene, ajhakuhenga ikangacho twe, ili kulangiya lilobhe lyake la jwenio ndi lya chakaka.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
